<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">II Wa Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">II WA YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">II Wa Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">II Wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">II WA YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1"/>Lè Achab te fin mouri, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2">II Sam 8:2</ref></char></note> Moab te fè rebelyon kont Israël.<verse eid="2KI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2"/>Konsa, Achazia te tonbe sou treyi a soti nan chanm anwo ki te nan Samarie a e li te vin malad. Konsa, li te voye mesaje yo. Li te di yo: “Ale mande a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:3-16">II Wa 1:3-16</ref></char></note>Baal-Zebub, dye a Ékron an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:7-10">II Wa 8:7-10</ref></char></note>si m ap geri de maladi sa a.”<verse eid="2KI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3"/>Men zanj SENYÈ a te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>Élie, Tichbit la: “Leve, ale monte pou rankontre mesaje a wa Samarie yo. Di yo: ‘Èske se akoz nanpwen Dye an Israël ke ou prale mande a Baal-Zebub, dye a Ékron an?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4"/>Alò, se pou sa, pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:6-16">II Wa 1:6-16</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap desann soti nan kabann kote ou te monte a, men ou va anverite, mouri.’” Konsa, Élie te pati.<verse eid="2KI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5"/>Lè mesaje yo te retounen bò kote li, li te di yo: “Se poukisa ke nou tounen an?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6"/>Yo te di li: “Yon nonm te vin rankontre nou e te di nou: ‘Ale retounen kote wa ki te voye nou an e di li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Èske se akoz nanpwen Dye an Israël ke w ap voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:2">II Wa 1:2</ref></char></note>mande a Baal-Zebub, dye a Ékron an? Pou sa, ou p ap desann Kabann kote ou fin monte a, men anverite, ou va mouri.’”’”<verse eid="2KI 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7"/>Li te di yo: “Ki kalite moun sa a ki te monte rankontre nou an pou te pale pawòl sila yo a nou?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8"/>Yo te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:4">Za 13:4</ref></char></note>“Yon nonm avèk anpil cheve ak yon sentiwon an kwi mare nan ren li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Li te di: “Se Élie, Tichbit la.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9"/>Konsa, wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:13-14">II Wa 6:13-14</ref></char></note>te voye kote li, yon kapitèn a senkant avèk senkant pa li yo. Li te monte kote li; men vwala, li te chita sou do ti mòn nan. Konsa, li te di li: “O nonm Bondye a, wa a di ou: ‘Desann.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10"/>Élie te reponn a kapitèn a senkant lan: “Si se yon nonm Bondye mwen ye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:36-38">I Wa 18:36-38</ref></char></note>ke dife vin desann nan syèl la e manje ou menm avèk senkant pa ou yo.” Epi dife te desann soti nan syèl la e te manje li nèt avèk senkant pa li yo.<verse eid="2KI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11"/>Konsa, li te voye kote li yon lòt kapitèn a senkant ansanm ak senkant pa li yo. Epi li te di li: “O nonm Bondye, konsa pale wa a: ‘Desann vit.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12"/>Élie te reponn yo: “Si mwen se yon nonm Bondye, ke dife desann nan syèl la e manje ou avèk senkant pa ou yo.” Epi dife Bondye a te desann sòti nan syèl la e te manje li nèt avèk senkant pa l yo.<verse eid="2KI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13"/>Konsa, li te voye ankò kapitèn a senkant avèk senkant pa li yo. Lè twazyèm kapitèn nan te monte, li te vini e te bese ba sou jenou li devan Élie. Li te sipliye li e te mande li: “O nonm Bondye, souple kite lavi mwen avèk senkant sèvitè ou yo gade kòm presye nan zye ou. <verse eid="2KI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14"/>Gade byen, dife te desann soti nan syèl la e te manje premye de kapitèn a senkant yo avèk senkant pa yo. Men koulye a, kite lavi mwen parèt presye nan zye ou.”<verse eid="2KI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15"/>Zanj SENYÈ a te di a Élie: “Ale desann avèk li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:12">És 51:12</ref> </char></note>Pa pè li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:15">Pou sa, li te leve e te desann avèk li kote wa a. <verse eid="2KI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16"/>Epi li te di li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Akoz ou te voye mesaje yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:3">II Wa 1:3</ref></char></note>pou mande a Baal-Zebub, dye a Ékron an—-èske se akoz nanpwen Dye an Israël pou mande pawòl Li? Pou sa, ou p ap desann kabann kote ou te monte a, men anverite, ou va mouri.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17"/>Konsa, Achazia te mouri selon pawòl SENYÈ a ke Élie te pale a. Epi akoz li pa t gen fis, Joram te devni wa nan plas li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:1">II Wa 3:1</ref></char></note>nan dezyèm ane a Joram, fis a Josaphat a, wa Juda a. <verse eid="2KI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv ke Achazia te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo?<verse eid="2KI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1"/>Li te vin rive lè SENYÈ a te prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Eb 11:5</ref></char></note>ranmase Élie monte nan syèl nan yon van toubiyon, ke Élie te ale avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:16-21">I Wa 19:16-21</ref></char></note>Élisée sòti Guilgal. <verse eid="2KI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2"/>Epi li te rive ke Élie te di a Élisée: “Rete isit la, souple; paske SENYÈ a te voye mwen jis Béthel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Men Élisée te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:16">Rt 1:16</ref></char></note>“Jan SENYÈ a viv la e jan ou menm viv la, mwen p ap kite ou.” Konsa, yo te desann Béthel.<verse eid="2KI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:1-38">II Wa 4:1-38</ref></char></note>fis a pwofèt ki te Béthel yo te vin sòti kote Élisée e te di li: “Èske ou konnen ke SENYÈ a va pran mèt ou a soti anwo ou jodi a?” Konsa, li te di:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">“Wi, mwen konnen. Pa pale!”<verse eid="2KI 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4"/>Élie te di li: “Élisée, souple, rete isit la, paske SENYÈ a te voye mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Jos 6:26</ref></char></note>Jéricho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Men li te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, mwen p ap kite ou”. Konsa, yo te vini Jéricho.<verse eid="2KI 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:3">II Wa 2:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a pwofèt ki te Jéricho yo te vin kote Élisée e te di li: “Èske ou konnen ke SENYÈ a va retire mèt ou a soti anwo ou jodi a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Li te reponn: “Wi, mwen konnen; pa pale.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6"/>Konsa, Élie te di li: “Souple, rete isit la, paske SENYÈ a te voye mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:8-17">Jos 3:8-17</ref></char></note>Jourdain an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Li te reponn: “Jan Senyè a viv la e jan ou menm viv la, mwen p ap kite ou.” Konsa yo de a te avanse. <verse eid="2KI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:15-16">II Wa 2:15-16</ref></char></note>senkant mesye nan fis a pwofèt yo te ale kanpe anfas yo nan yon distans, pandan yo de a te kanpe akote Jourdain an. <verse eid="2KI 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8"/>Élie te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:13-19">I Wa 19:13-19</ref></char></note>pran manto li, li te pliye li ansanm, li te frape dlo yo e yo te vin divize isit e la, jiskaske yo de a te travèse sou tè sèch. <verse eid="2KI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9"/>Lè yo te fin travèse, Élie te di a Élisée: “Mande sa ke m ta fè pou ou avan mwen retire m de ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Konsa, Élisée te di: “Souple, kite yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:17-25">Nonb 11:17-25</ref></char></note>pòsyon doub nan lespri ou a rete sou mwen.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10"/>Li te di: “Ou te mande yon bagay ki difisil. Si ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:10">Trav 1:10</ref> </char></note>wè m lè m retire kite ou, se konsa l ap ye pou ou; men si se pa sa, sa p ap fèt.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11"/>Pandan yo t ap fè wout yo e t ap prale, men vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17">II Wa 6:17</ref></char></note>yon cha dife avèk cheval dife te separe yo de a. Konsa, Élie te monte nan yon toubiyon nan syèl la. <verse eid="2KI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12"/>Élisée te wè e te kriye fò: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:14">II Wa 13:14</ref></char></note>“Papa m, papa m, cha Israël yo avèk chevalye li yo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:12">Epi li pa t wè Élie ankò. Alò, li te kenbe rad li e te chire li an de bout. <verse eid="2KI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13"/>Anplis, li te pran manto Élie ki te sòti tonbe de li, lè l t ap prale a, e li te retounen kanpe akote rebò larivyè Jourdain an. <verse eid="2KI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14"/>Li te pran manto Élie ki te tonbe de li menm nan, e li te frape dlo yo e te di: “Kote SENYÈ a, Bondye Élie a?” Epi lè l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:8">II Wa 2:8</ref></char></note>frape dlo a ankò, yo te divize isit e la, epi Élisée te travèse rive lòtbò.<verse eid="2KI 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:7">II Wa 2:7</ref></char></note>lè fis a pwofèt ki te Jéricho yo te wè li, yo te di: “Lespri Élie a poze sou Élisée.” Epi yo te vin rankontre li e te bese yo menm atè devan li. <verse eid="2KI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16"/>Yo te di li: “Men vwala, genyen avèk ou senkant sèvitè ak gwo fòs, souple, kite yo ale chache mèt ou a. Petèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:12">I Wa 18:12</ref></char></note>lespri a SENYÈ a te pran li e te jete li sou yon mòn, oswa nan yon vale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Li te di: “Ou p ap voye yo.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17"/>Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:11">II Wa 8:11</ref></char></note>yo te bourade li jiskaske li te wont, li te di yo: “Voye yo”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:17">Konsa, yo te voye senkant mesye. Yo te chache pandan twa jou, men yo pa t jwenn li. <verse eid="2KI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18"/>Yo te retounen kote li pandan li te rete Jéricho a. Li te di yo: “Èske mwen pa t di nou ‘Pa ale’?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19"/>Konsa, mesye lavil yo te di a Élisée: “Gade byen koulye a, sikonstans vil sa a byen bon, jan mèt mwen konn wè a; men dlo a pa bon e tè a pa pwodwi anyen.”<verse eid="2KI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20"/>Li te di: “Mennen ban m yon veso nèf e mete sèl ladann.” Konsa, yo te mennen ba li. <verse eid="2KI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21"/>Li te ale nan sous dlo a. Li te jete sèl la ladann e te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Mwen te pirifye dlo sa yo! P ap gen lanmò ni move tè a ankò.’” <verse eid="2KI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22"/>Konsa, dlo yo rete bon jis jodi a, selon pawòl Élisée te pale a.<verse eid="2KI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23"/>Alò, soti la, li te monte Béthel. Pandan li t ap monte nan chemen an, jenn gason yo te sòti deyò soti lavil la. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref></char></note>moke li e te di li: “Ale monte, tèt chòv! Ale monte, tèt chòv!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24"/>Lè li te gade dèyè li pou l te wè yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:25-27">Né 13:25-27</ref></char></note>modi yo nan non SENYÈ a. Konsa, de lous femèl te sòti nan forè a, e te chire karann-de nan jenn gason pami yo. <verse eid="2KI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25"/>Li te kite la pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19-20">I Wa 18:19-20</ref></char></note>Mòn Carmel, e soti la, li te rive Samarie.<verse eid="2KI 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1"/>Alò Joram, fis Achab la te devni Wa sou Israël nan Samarie <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:17">II Wa 1:17</ref></char></note>nan di-zuityèm ane a Josaphat, wa Juda a, e li te renye pandan douzan. <verse eid="2KI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, malgre, se pa tankou papa li avèk manman li. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:24">Egz 23:24</ref></char></note>li te retire pilye sakre a Baal ke papa li te fè a. <verse eid="2KI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3"/>Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-32">I Wa 12:28-32</ref> </char></note>li te kenbe rèd a peche Jéroboam, fis a Nebat la. Avèk sila li te fè Israël peche a. Li pa t kite yo.<verse eid="2KI 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4"/>Alò, Mesha, wa Moab la te yon mèt ki fò nan pran swen mouton. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2">II Sam 8:2</ref></char></note>te konn peye wa Israël la avèk lenn a san-mil jenn mouton ansanm avèk lenn san-mil belye. <verse eid="2KI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:1">II Wa 1:1</ref></char></note>lè Achab te vin mouri, wa Moab la te fè rebèl kont wa Israël la. <verse eid="2KI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6"/>Konsa, wa Joram te kite Samarie nan tan sa a pou te rasanble tout Israël. <verse eid="2KI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7"/>Alò, li te voye kote Josaphat, wa Juda a. Li te di: “Wa Moab la te fè rebèl kont mwen. Èske ou va monte avè m pou goumen kont Moab?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Li te reponn: “M ap monte. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:4">I Wa 22:4</ref></char></note>Mwen tankou ou menm e pèp mwen an tankou pèp pa w la, cheval mwen yo tankou cheval pa ou yo.” <verse eid="2KI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8"/>Konsa, li te mande: “Nan ki chemen nou dwe monte?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Wa Joram te reponn: “Pa chemen dezè ki nan Édom an.” <verse eid="2KI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9"/>Konsa, wa Israël la te ale avèk wa Juda a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:47">I Wa 22:47</ref></char></note>wa Édom an e nan vwayaj la, yo fè yon tou mache pandan sèt jou, e pa t gen dlo pou lame a ak pou betay ki te swiv yo. <verse eid="2KI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10"/>Alò, wa Israël la te di: “Elas! Konsa SENYÈ a te rele twa wa sa yo pou lage yo nan men Moab.”<verse eid="2KI 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11"/>Men Josaphat te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:7">I Wa 22:7</ref></char></note>“Èske pa gen yon pwofèt SENYÈ a isit la, pou nou kapab fè demann SENYÈ a pa li menm?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Youn nan sèvitè wa yo te reponn. Li te di: “Élisée, fis a Schaphath la, ki te konn vide dlo sou men a Élie yo isit la.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12"/>Josaphat te di: “Pawòl SENYÈ a avèk li.” Konsa, wa Israël la avèk Josaphat, avèk wa Édom an te desann kote li.<verse eid="2KI 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13"/>Alò, Élisée te di a wa Israël la: “Kisa m gen avè w? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">I Wa 18:19</ref></char></note>Ale kote pwofèt a papa ou avèk pwofèt a manman ou yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Wa Israël la te reponn: “Non, paske SENYÈ a te rele twa wa sila yo ansanm pou livre yo nan men a wa Moab la.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14"/>Élisée te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>“Jan SENYÈ a viv la, devan sila mwen kanpe a, si se pa ke m respekte prezans a Josaphat, wa Juda a, mwen pa t ap gade ou, ni wè ou. <verse eid="2KI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15"/>Men koulye a, mennen ban mwen yon mizisyen.” Epi li te vin rive ke lè mizisyen an te jwe, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:46">I Wa 18:46</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a te vini sou Elisée. <verse eid="2KI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16"/>Li te di: “Konsa di SENYÈ a: ‘Fè vale sila a vin ranpli avèk kanal.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Ou p ap wè van ni ou p ap wè lapli. Malgre sa, vale sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:35">Sòm 107:35</ref></char></note>va vin ranpli avèk dlo pou nou kab bwè; ni nou, ni bèf nou yo, ni bèt nou yo. <verse eid="2KI 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18"/>Sa se sèlman yon tikras bagay nan zye SENYÈ a. Anplis, Li va livre Moabit yo nan men nou. <verse eid="2KI 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:25">II Wa 3:25</ref></char></note>Konsa, nou va frape chak vil ki fòtifye e chak nan pi bèl vil yo, koupe mete atè tout bon pyebwa, bouche tout sous dlo e gate tout bon mòso tè avèk wòch yo.’”<verse eid="2KI 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20"/>Li te vin rive nan maten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39-40">Egz 29:39-40</ref></char></note>vè lè pou ofri sakrifis la, ke vwala, dlo te sòti vè direksyon Édom e peyi a te vin ranpli avèk dlo.<verse eid="2KI 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21"/>Alò, tout Moabit yo te tande ke wa yo te monte pou goumen kont yo. Epi tout moun ki te kapab, te mete vètman pwotèj yo e sila avèk plis laj yo te resevwa lòd pou vin kanpe sou lizyè fwontyè a. <verse eid="2KI 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22"/>Yo te leve bonè nan maten, solèy la te vin klere sou dlo a, e Moabit yo te wè dlo anfas yo a wouj tankou san. <verse eid="2KI 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23"/>Konsa, yo te di: “Sa se san. Asireman, wa yo te goumen ansanm e youn te touye lòt. Pou sa, Moab, antre pran piyaj la!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24"/>Men lè yo te rive nan kan Israël la, Izrayelit yo te leve e te frape Moabit yo jiskaske yo te kouri devan yo. Epi yo te avanse nan peyi a e te fè yon gwo masak pami Moabit yo. <verse eid="2KI 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:19">II Wa 3:19</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te detwi vil yo, epi chak moun te jete yon wòch sou chak mòso bon tè pou te plen yo. Epi yo te bouche tout sous dlo yo e te koupe tout bon pyebwa yo, jis yo rive nan Kir-Haréseth kote se sèl wòch li yo ki rete. Men mesye fistibal yo te antoure li e te frape li. <verse eid="2KI 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26"/>Lè wa Moab la te wè ke batay la te twò mechan pou li, li te pran avèk li sèt-san mesye ki te rale nepe pou ouvri yon pasaj pou rive kote wa Édom an; men yo pa t kapab. <verse eid="2KI 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27"/>Alò, li te pran pi gran fis li a ki te gen pou renye nan plas li, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:1">Am 2:1</ref></char></note>ofri li kòm yon ofrann brile sou mi lan. Epi te vin gen lakòlè byen cho kont Israël, e yo te kite li pou retounen nan peyi pa yo.<verse eid="2KI 3:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1"/>Alò, yon sèten fanm pami madanm fis a pwofèt yo te kriye kont Élisée: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:3">II Wa 2:3</ref></char></note>“Sèvitè ou a, mari mwen an mouri e ou konnen ke sèvitè ou te gen lakrent SENYÈ a. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-41">Lev 25:39-41-48</ref></char></note>mesye ki vèse prè kòb la, gen tan parèt pou pran de pitit mwen yo kòm esklav li.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2"/>Élisée te di li: “Kisa pou m ta fè pou ou? Di mwen kisa ou gen nan kay la?” Epi li te di: “Sèvant ou pa gen anyen nan kay la sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:12">I Wa 17:12</ref></char></note>yon bokal lwil.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3"/>Alò, li te di: “Ale, prete veso vid toupatou pou kont ou nan men tout vwazen ou yo. Pa manke pran anpil. <verse eid="2KI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4"/>Ou va antre anndan, fèmen pòt la dèyè ou avèk fis ou yo, vide nan tout veso sa yo, e sa ki plen yo, mete yo akote.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5"/>Konsa, li te ale kite li e te fèmen pòt la dèyè li avèk fis li yo. Yo t ap mennen veso kote li pou l te plen. <verse eid="2KI 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6"/>Lè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:20">Mat 14:20</ref></char></note>veso yo te plen li te di a fis li yo: “Mennen ban mwen yon lòt veso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Epi li reponn li: “Nanpwen menm yon veso ankò.” Konsa, lwil la te sispann.<verse eid="2KI 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7"/>Alò, li te vin pale nonm Bondye a. Li te di l: “Ale vann lwil la pou peye dèt ou. Epi ou menm avèk fis ou yo kab viv sou sa ki rete a.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8"/>Alò, te vin rive yon jou lè Élisée te pase bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:18">Jos 19:18</ref></char></note>Sunem, kote te gen yon fanm enpòtan. Konsa, fanm nan te konvenk li manje pen. Se konsa li te vin rive, ke nenpòt lè li te pase, li te vire antre la pou manje pen. <verse eid="2KI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9"/>Fanm nan te di a mari li: “Gade byen, mwen apèsi ke sa se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:7">II Wa 4:7</ref></char></note>nonm sen a Bondye k ap pase bò kote nou tout tan. <verse eid="2KI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10"/>Souple, annou fè yon ti chanm sou twati kay la. Annou mete yon kabann pou li la, avèk yon tab ak chèz avèk yon chandelye. Konsa li va ye ke lè li vini kote nou, li kapab vire antre la.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11"/>Yon jou, li te vini la e te vire antre nan chanm anwo a pou te repoze. <verse eid="2KI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12"/>Konsa li te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:29-31">II Wa 4:29-31</ref></char></note>Guéhazi, sèvitè li a: “Rele fanm Sinamit lan.” Epi lè li te fin rele li, li te parèt kanpe devan l. <verse eid="2KI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13"/>Li te di Guéhazi: “Koulye a di li: ‘Gade, ou te byen pran swen nou avèk tout swen sila a. Se kisa nou kapab fè pou ou? Èske ou ta renmen m pale ak wa a pou ou, oswa kapitèn lame a?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Li te reponn: “Mwen rete pami pwòp pèp pa m.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14"/>Konsa, li te mande: “Alò, se kisa ki kab fèt pou li?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Epi Guéhazi te reponn: “Anverite, li pa gen fis, e mari li fin granmoun.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15"/>Li te di: “Rele li.” Lè li te rele li, li te kanpe nan pòtay la. <verse eid="2KI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16"/>Epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Jen 18:14</ref></char></note>“Nan sezon sila nan ane k ap vini an, ou va anbrase yon fis.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Epi li te reponn: “Non, mèt mwen, O nonm Bondye a, pa bay manti a sèvant ou.”<verse eid="2KI 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17"/>Konsa, Fanm nan te vin ansent e te fè yon fis nan menm sezon sa a nan ane ki vini an, jan Élisée te pale li a. <verse eid="2KI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18"/>Lè pitit la te fin grandi, jou a te rive pou li te ale kote papa li avèk moun rekòlt yo. <verse eid="2KI 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19"/>Li te di a papa li: “Tèt mwen, tèt mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Epi papa l te pale sèvitè li: “Pote li bay manman li.”<verse eid="2KI 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20"/>Lè li te pran li pou te mennen li bay manman l, li te chita sou jenou li jis rive midi e li te mouri. <verse eid="2KI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21"/>Li te monte anlè a, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:32">II Wa 4:32</ref></char></note>kouche li sou kabann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:7">II Wa 4:7</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye a, li te fèmen pòt la dèyè l e li te sòti. <verse eid="2KI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22"/>Konsa, li te rele mari li, e li te di l: “Souple, voye ban m youn nan bourik yo pou m ka al jwenn nonm Bondye a epi tounen.”<verse eid="2KI 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23"/>Li te di, “Poukisa ou w ap al kote l jodi a? Lalin pa nèf, ni li pa Saba a.” Li te reponn: “L ap bon.”<verse eid="2KI 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24"/>Alò, li te sele yon bourik e te di a sèvitè li: “Kondwi pou avanse! Pa ralanti vitès sof ke se mwen ki di ou sa.”<verse eid="2KI 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25"/>Konsa li te ale e te vin kote nonm Bondye a sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:25">II Wa 2:25</ref></char></note>Mòn Carmel. Lè nonm Bondye a te wè li a yon distans li te di a Guéhazi, sèvitè li a: “Men vwala se Sinamit lan. <verse eid="2KI 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26"/>Souple, kouri koulye a rankontre li, epi mande li: ‘Èske tout bagay byen pou ou? Èske sa byen pou mari ou? Èske sa byen pou fis ou a?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Konsa, li te reponn: “L ap bon”.<verse eid="2KI 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27"/>Lè l te rive kote nonm Bondye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:25">II Wa 4:25</ref></char></note>sou ti mòn nan, li te kenbe de pye li. Guéhazi te parèt pou pouse l fè l sòti; men nonm Bondye a te di: “Kite li, paske nanm li twouble anndan l. SENYÈ a te kache sa de mwen sa, e pa t di m sa.”<verse eid="2KI 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28"/>Fanm nan te di: “Èske mwen te mande mèt mwen pou yon fis? Èske mwen pa t di ou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:16">II Wa 4:16</ref></char></note>‘Pa twonpe m’?”<verse eid="2KI 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29"/>Alò, li te di a Guéhazi: “Mare senti ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:14">II Wa 2:14</ref></char></note>pran baton mwen nan men ou pou al fè wout ou. Si ou rankontre nenpòt moun, pa salye li, e si nenpòt moun salye ou, pa reponn li. Al mete baton mwen an kouche sou figi gason an.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30"/>Manman a gason an te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:2-4">II Wa 2:2-4</ref></char></note>“Jan SENYÈ a viv la, e jan ou menm viv la, mwen p ap kite ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:30">Konsa, li te leve e te swiv li.<verse eid="2KI 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31"/>Guéhazi te pase devan yo e te kouche baton an sou figi a gason an, men li pa t fè bwi, ni li pa t reponn. Konsa, li te retounen rankontre Élisée e te di li: “Gason an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:11">Jn 11:11</ref></char></note>pa t leve.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32"/>Lè Élisée te vini nan kay la, men vwala, gason an te kouche tou mouri sou kabann li an. <verse eid="2KI 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:4">II Wa 4:4</ref></char></note>li te antre fèmen pòt la dèyè yo toude a, e te priye a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34"/>Konsa, li te pwoche kouche sou pitit la, li te mete bouch li sou bouch pa li, zye li sou zye pa li, men li sou men pa li. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21-23">I Wa 17:21-23</ref></char></note>lonje kò li sou li, e chè pitit la te kòmanse vin cho. <verse eid="2KI 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35"/>Li te retounen nan kay la e te mache yon fwa ale retou, epi li te monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21">I Wa 17:21</ref></char></note>lonje li menm sou li. Gason an te touse sèt fwa e gason an te ouvri zye li. <verse eid="2KI 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36"/>Li te rele Guéhazi e te di: “Rele Sinamit lan.” Konsa, li te rele li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:36">Lè li te antre kote li, li te di: “Ranmase pran pitit ou a.”<verse eid="2KI 4:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37"/>Alò, fanm nan te antre anndan; li te tonbe nan pye li e li te bese li menm jis atè. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:35">Eb 11:35</ref></char></note>li te pran fis li, e te sòti.<verse eid="2KI 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38"/>Lè Élisée te retounen Guilgal, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:1">II Wa 8:1</ref></char></note>gwo grangou nan peyi a. Pandan fis a pwofèt yo te chita devan l, li te di a sèvitè li a: “Mete gwo bonm nan e fè yon bouyon pou fis a pwofèt yo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39"/>Epi youn te ale nan chan an pou ranmase epis yo e yo te twouve yon lyann sovaj. Li te ranmase sou li kont joumou pou plen vètman li. Li te vin koupe yo, pou fè yo antre nan bouyon, paske yo pa t rekonèt yo. <verse eid="2KI 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40"/>Konsa, yo te vide li pou mesye yo manje. Epi pandan yo t ap bwè bouyon an, yo te kriye fò. Yo te di: “O nonm Bondye, gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:17">Egz 10:17</ref></char></note>lanmò nan po a.” Epi yo pa t kab manje.<verse eid="2KI 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41"/>Men li te di: “Alò, pote sereyal moulen an.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:25">Egz 15:25</ref></char></note>Li te jete li nan bonm nan e te di: “Vide li pou pèp la pou yo kab manje.” Epi pa t gen okenn mal nan po a.<verse eid="2KI 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42"/>Alò, yon mesye te sòti Baal-Shalisha, e li te pote pou nonm Bondye a, pen premye fwi yo, ven pen lòj avèk tèt sereyal nèf nan sak li. Epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:16-21">Mat 14:16-21</ref></char></note>“Bay pèp la pou yo kab manje.”<verse eid="2KI 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43"/>Asistan li an te di: “Kisa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:13">Luc 9:13</ref></char></note>èske mwen va mete sa a devan san moun?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Men li te di: “Bay pèp la pou yo kab manje, paske se konsa SENYÈ a pale: ‘Yo va manje e va genyen ki rete.’”<verse eid="2KI 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44"/>Konsa, li te mete li devan yo, yo te manje e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:20">Mat 14:20</ref></char></note>genyen ki te rete, selon pawòl SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2KI 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:27">Luc 4:27</ref></char></note>Naaman, kapitèn lame a wa Syrie a, te yon mesye enpòtan a mèt li e li te estime anpil. Akoz li menm, SENYÈ a te bay yon viktwa pou Syrie. Anplis, mesye a te yon gèrye gran kouraj, men li te gen lalèp. <verse eid="2KI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2"/>Alò, Siryen yo te sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:23">II Wa 6:23</ref></char></note>pa ekip e yo te pran an kaptivite yon jenn tifi nan peyi Israël; epi li te sèvi madanm a Naaman an. <verse eid="2KI 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3"/>Li te pale konsa a mètrès li a: “Mwen ta tèlman vle ke mèt mwen an te avèk pwofèt Samarie a! Konsa, li ta geri li pou l pa gen lalèp la.”<verse eid="2KI 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4"/>Naaman te antre kote mèt li a e te di: “Men konsa, fi ki sòti peyi Israël la te pale.”<verse eid="2KI 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5"/>Alò, wa Syrie a te di: “Ale koulye a e mwen va voye yon lèt kote wa Israël la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:5">Li te sòti e te pran avè l dis talan ajan ak si-mil sik an lò ak dis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:12">Jij 14:12</ref></char></note>echanj vètman konplè. <verse eid="2KI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6"/>Li te mennen lèt la bay wa Israël la ki te di: “Epi koulye a, kòmsi lèt sa a rive bò kote ou, men vwala, mwen te voye Naaman, sèvitè mwen an kote ou, pou ou kab geri li nan afè lalèp sila a.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7"/>Lè wa Israël la te li lèt sa a, li te chire rad li. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:2">Jen 30:2</ref></char></note>“Èske se Bondye mwen ye, pou m kab touye e fè viv, pou nonm sa ta voye kote mwen pou geri yon mesye ki gen lalèp? Men gade byen kijan l ap chache yon kont avè m.”<verse eid="2KI 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8"/>Li te rive ke lè Élisée, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:22">I Wa 12:22</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye a te tande ke wa Israël la te chire rad li, li te voye kote wa a e te di: “Poukisa ou chire rad ou konsa? Koulye a, kite li vin kote mwen e li va konnen ke gen yon pwofèt an Israël.”<verse eid="2KI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9"/>Konsa, Naaman te vini avèk cheval li yo ak cha li yo e te kanpe devan pòtay lakay Élisée. <verse eid="2KI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10"/>Élisée te voye yon mesaje kote li ki te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:7">Jn 9:7</ref></char></note>“Ale benyen nan Jourdain an sèt fwa. Chè ou va restore a ou menm e ou va vin pwòp.”<verse eid="2KI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11"/>Men Naaman te vin byen fache. Li te sòti e te di: “Gade byen, mwen te konnen ke asireman, li ta parèt deyò kote mwen, kanpe pou rele non SENYÈ a, Bondye li a e voye men li sou plas pou geri moun lalèp la. <verse eid="2KI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12"/>Èske rivyè Abana avèk Parpar nan Damas yo pa pi bon ke tout flèv Israël yo? Èske mwen pa t kab lave m nan yo e vin pwòp?” Konsa, li te vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:17">Pwov 14:17</ref></char></note>sòti byen anraje.<verse eid="2KI 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13"/>Alò, sèvitè li yo te pwoche; yo te pale avèk li e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:12">II Wa 2:12</ref></char></note>“Papa mwen, si pwofèt la te di ou pou fè yon gwo bagay, èske ou pa t ap fè l. Konbyen, anplis, lè li di ou ‘Lave ou pou vin pwòp?’”<verse eid="2KI 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14"/>Pou sa, li te desann e te fonse kò l sèt fwa nan Jourdain an, selon pawòl a nonm Bondye a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:10">II Wa 5:10</ref></char></note>chè li te restore tankou chè a yon timoun, e li te vin pwòp. <verse eid="2KI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15"/>Lè li te retounen kote nonm Bondye a avèk tout konpanyen li e te vin kanpe devan li, li te di: “Gade byen, koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:11">Jos 2:11</ref></char></note>mwen konnen ke nanpwen lòt Dye nan tout tè a, sof ke an Israël. Pou sa, souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:27">I Sam 25:27</ref></char></note>aksepte yon kado nan men sèvitè ou a depi koulye a.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16"/>Men li te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, devan sila mwen kanpe a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:22">Jen 14:22</ref></char></note>mwen p ap pran anyen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:16">Konsa, li te ankouraje l pran, men li te refize. <verse eid="2KI 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17"/>Naaman te di: “Malgre, si se pa sa, souple, bay sèvitè ou a chaj de milèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:24">Egz 20:24</ref></char></note>tè; paske sèvitè ou a p ap ofri ofrann brile ni sakrifis a lòt dye, men a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18"/>Nan ka sa a, ke SENYÈ a kapab padone sèvitè ou a: lè mèt mwen antre nan kay Rimmon an, pou adore la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:2-17">II Wa 7:2-17</ref> </char></note>li va apiye sou men m e mwen va bese lakay Rimmon an, pou SENYÈ a kapab padone sèvitè ou a nan ka sa a.”<verse eid="2KI 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19"/>Li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:18">Egz 4:18</ref> </char></note>“Ale anpè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Konsa, li te pati de li a yon distans. <verse eid="2KI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:12-36">II Wa 4:12-36</ref></char></note>Guéhazi, sèvitè Élisée a, nonm Bondye a, te reflechi: “Men gade, mèt mwen an te konsève Naaman sila a, Siryen an, pwiske li pa resevwa nan men l sa ke li te pote a. Jan SENYÈ a viv la, mwen ap kouri dèyè l e pran yon bagay de li menm.”<verse eid="2KI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21"/>Konsa, Guéhazi te kouri dèyè Naaman. Lè Naaman te wè yon moun vin kouri dèyè li, li te desann cha a pou rankontre li. Li te di: “Èske tout bagay byen?”<verse eid="2KI 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22"/>Li te di: “Tout bagay byen. Mèt mwen an voye mwen. Li te di: ‘Gade byen, soti koulye a, de jenn mesye ki pami fis a pwofèt yo te vin kote mwen soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:33">Jos 24:33</ref></char></note>peyi ti mòn Ephraïm yo. Souple, ba yo yon talan ajan ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:5">II Wa 5:5</ref></char></note>de echanj konplè nan vètman yo.’”<verse eid="2KI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23"/>Naaman te di: “Avèk plezi, pran de talan yo.” Epi li te ankouraje li. Li te mare de talan ajan yo nan de sak avèk de echanj konplè nan rad yo, e li te bay yo a de sèvitè li yo, epi yo te pote yo devan li. <verse eid="2KI 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24"/>Lè li te rive kote ti mòn nan, li te pran yo soti nan men yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1-21">Jos 7:1-21</ref></char></note>mete yo nan kay la, li te voye mesye yo ale e yo te pati. <verse eid="2KI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25"/>Men li te antre ladann e te kanpe devan mèt li. Konsa, Elisée te di li: “Kote ou te ye Guéhazi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Li te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:22">II Wa 5:22</ref></char></note>“Sèvitè ou a pa t ale okenn kote non.” <verse eid="2KI 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26"/>Epi li te di l: “Èske kè m pa t sòti lè mesye a te vire kite cha li pou vin rankontre ou a? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:16">II Wa 5:16</ref></char></note>Èske sa se lè pou resevwa lajan, pou resevwa rad, chan doliv avèk chan rezen, avèk mouton ak bèf ak sèvitè avèk sèvant? <verse eid="2KI 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27"/>Pou sa, lalèp Naaman an ap kole sou ou avèk desandan ou yo jis pou tout tan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:27">Konsa, li te kite prezans li kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:6">Egz 4:6</ref></char></note>yon lèp blan tankou lanèj.<verse eid="2KI 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:3">II Wa 2:3</ref></char></note>fis a pwofèt yo te di a Élisée: “Gade byen, plas devan ou kote nou rete a twò piti pou nou. <verse eid="2KI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2"/>Souple, annou ale nan Jourdain an e chak nan nou pran soti la yon poto epi annou fè yon plas pou pwòp tèt nou kote nou kab rete a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Li te reponn: “Ale.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3"/>Alò youn nan yo te di: “Souple, fè dakò pou ale avèk sèvitè nou yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Li te reponn: “M ap prale.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4"/>Konsa, li te ale avèk yo. Lè yo rive kote Jourdain an, yo te koupe bwa yo. <verse eid="2KI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5"/>Men pandan youn nan yo t ap fè tonbe yon poto, tèt rach la te tonbe nan dlo. Nom nan te kriye fò e te di: “Anmwey, mèt mwen! Paske se prete li te ye!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6"/>Epi nonm Bondye a te di: “Se kibò li te tonbe?” Epi lè li te montre li kote a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:25">Egz 15:25</ref></char></note>li te koupe yon bout bwa, e li te voye ladann pou te fè fè a vin monte sou dlo a. <verse eid="2KI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7"/>Li te di: “Ranmase l pou kont ou.” Konsa, li te lonje men li pou te pran l.<verse eid="2KI 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8"/>Alò, wa Syrie a te fè lagè kont Israël, epi li te konsilte avèk sèvitè li yo. Li te di: “Antre tèl kote ak tèl kote, ki kote nou va fè kan an.”<verse eid="2KI 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 4:1-7">II Wa 4:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nonm Bondye a te voye kote wa Israël la. Li te di: “Veye pou ou pa pase nan kote sila a, paske Siryen yo ap desann la.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10"/>Wa Israël la te voye nan plas kote nonm Bondye a te pale li a pou avèti l. Konsa, plis ke yon fwa oswa de fwa, li te sove li plizyè fwa. <verse eid="2KI 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11"/>Alò, kè a wa Syrie a te anraje sou afè sa a. Li te rele sèvitè li yo e te di yo: “Èske ou va di mwen kilès nan nou ki pou wa Israël la?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12"/>Youn nan sèvitè li yo te di: “Non, mèt mwen, O wa a; men Élisée, pwofèt ki an Israël la ap pale wa Israël la pawòl ke ou pale menm nan chanm dòmi ou.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13"/>Konsa, li te di: “Ale wè kote li ye a pou m kab voye pran l.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:13">Epi yo te pale li, e te di: “Gade, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:17">Jen 37:17</ref></char></note>Dothan.”<verse eid="2KI 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14"/>Li te voye cheval avèk cha avèk yon gwo lame la. Yo te vini pandan lannwit e te antoure vil la. <verse eid="2KI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15"/>Alò, lè sèvitè a nonm Bondye a te leve bonè pou te sòti deyò, vwala, yon lame avèk cheval ak cha te antoure vil la. Epi sèvitè li a te di li: “Anmwey, mèt mwen! Kisa n ap fè?”<verse eid="2KI 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16"/>Konsa, li te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13">Egz 14:13</ref></char></note>“Pa pè, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:31">Wo 8:31</ref></char></note>sila ki avèk nou yo plis pase sila ki avèk yo a.” <verse eid="2KI 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17"/>Epi Élisée te priye e te di: “O SENYÈ, Mwen priye, ouvri zye li pou li kapab wè.” Epi SENYÈ a te ouvri zye a sèvitè li pou li te wè. Men vwala, tout mòn nan te ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:17">Sòm 68:17</ref></char></note>cheval avèk cha dife toupatou te antoure Élisée. <verse eid="2KI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18"/>Lè yo te desann kote li, Élisée te priye a SENYÈ a e te di: “Mwen priye, frape pèp sa a pou fè yo vin avèg.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:18">Konsa, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:11">Jen 19:11</ref></char></note>frape yo pou fè yo vin avèg selon pawòl Élisée a.<verse eid="2KI 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19"/>Konsa, Élisée te di yo: “Sa se pa chemen, ni se pa vil sa a. Swiv mwen e mwen va mennen ou kote nonm ke w ap chache a.” Epi li te mennen yo rive Samarie. <verse eid="2KI 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20"/>Lè yo te rive Samarie, Élisée te di: “O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17">II Wa 6:17</ref></char></note>SENYÈ, ouvri zye a moun sila yo pou yo kapab wè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:20">Konsa, SENYÈ a te ouvri zye yo pou yo te wè; epi vwala, yo te nan mitan Samarie.<verse eid="2KI 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21"/>Konsa, wa Israël la, lè li te wè yo, li te di Élisée: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:12">II Wa 2:12</ref></char></note>“Papa mwen, èske m dwe touye yo? Èske m dwe touye yo?”<verse eid="2KI 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22"/>Li te reponn: “Ou pa pou touye yo. Èske ou ta touye sila ke ou fin pran an kaptivite avèk nepe oubyen ak banza ou? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:20">Wo 12:20</ref></char></note>Mete pen avèk dlo devan yo pou yo kab manje ak bwè e ale kote mèt pa yo.”<verse eid="2KI 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23"/>Konsa, li te prepare yon gran repa pou yo, epi lè yo te fin manje e bwè, li te voye yo ale. Yo te ale kote mèt pa yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:2">II Wa 5:2</ref></char></note>bann piyajè Siryen yo pa t vini ankò nan peyi Israël.<verse eid="2KI 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:1">I Wa 20:1</ref></char></note>Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, te rasanble tout lame li a e te monte fè syèj kont Samarie. <verse eid="2KI 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25"/>Te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:26">Lev 26:26</ref></char></note>gwo grangou nan Samarie. Konsa, gade byen, yo te fè syèj la jis li rive ke tèt a yon bourik te vann pou katreven sik an ajan e yon ka kab poupou toutrèl pou senk sik ajan. <verse eid="2KI 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26"/>Pandan wa Israël la t ap pase sou mi an, yon fanm te kriye fò a li menm e te di: “Fè m sekou, mèt mwen, O Wa a!”<verse eid="2KI 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27"/>Wa a te di: “Si SENYÈ a pa ede ou, soti kibò mwen kab ede ou? Depi nan glasi vannen an, oswa avèk aparèy peze rezen an?” <verse eid="2KI 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28"/>Epi wa a te mande l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:23">Jij 18:23</ref></char></note>“Kisa ou genyen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Epi li te reponn: “Fanm sa a te di mwen: ‘Ban m ti fis ou a pou nou kab manje li jodi a e nou va manje fis pa ou a demen.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:27-29">Lev 26:27-29</ref></char></note>Konsa, nou te bouyi fis mwen an e manje li; epi mwen te di li sou jou ki vini an: ‘Ban m fis ou a pou nou kab manje li,’ men li te kache fis li a.”<verse eid="2KI 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30"/>Lè wa a te tande pawòl a fanm nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:27">I Wa 21:27</ref></char></note>li te chire rad li—epi koulye a, li t ap pase sou mi an—-e pèp la t ap gade, epi vwala, li te gen twal sak anba vètman a sou kò li. <verse eid="2KI 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31"/>Konsa, li te di: “Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:17">Rt 1:17</ref></char></note>Bondye fè m sa, e menm plis, si tèt a Élisée, fis a Schaphath la rete sou kò li jodi a.”<verse eid="2KI 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32"/>Alò, Élisée te chita lakay li a, e ansyen yo te chita avèk li. Epi wa a te voye yon mesye soti nan prezans li; men avan mesaje a te rive kote li, Élisée te di a ansyen yo: “Èske ou wè kijan mesye sa a, fis a yon asasen te voye pou retire pran tèt mwen? Gade, lè mesaje a vini, fèmen pòt la kont li e kenbe pòt la fèmen kont li. Èske se pa son a pye mèt li a ki dèyè li?”<verse eid="2KI 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33"/>Pandan li te toujou ap pale avèk yo, men vwala, mesaje a te desann kote li. Li te di: “Men gade, mechanste sa a sòti nan SENYÈ a; poukisa mwen ta dwe tann SENYÈ a ankò?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1"/>Epi Élisée te di: “Koute pawòl SENYÈ a. Konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:18">II Wa 7:18</ref></char></note>‘Demen vè lè sa a, yon mezi farin fen va vann pou yon sik, e de mezi lòj pou yon sik nan pòtay Samarie a.’”<verse eid="2KI 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2"/>Ofisye wayal la sou men a sila wa a te apiye a te reponn nonm Bondye a. Li te di: “Gade byen, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Jen 7:11</ref></char></note>si SENYÈ a ta fè fenèt nan syèl la, èske bagay sa a ta kab rive?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Konsa, Élisée te reponn: “Gade byen, ou va wè l ak pwòp zye pa w, men ou p ap manje ladann.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3"/>Alò, te genyen kat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:2-4">Nonb 5:2-4</ref></char></note>mesye lalèp nan antre pòtay la. Yo te di youn ak lòt: “Poukisa n ap chita la jiskaske nou mouri? <verse eid="2KI 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4"/>Si nou di: ‘N ap antre nan vil la’, alò grangou nan vil la, nou va mouri la. Epi si nou chita isit la, nou va mouri tou. Pou sa, vini, annou janbe lòtbò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:24">II Wa 6:24</ref></char></note>nan kan Siryen yo. Si yo lese nou viv, nou va viv; epi si yo touye nou, nou p ap gen plis pase mouri.”<verse eid="2KI 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5"/>Konsa, yo te leve avan l fènwa pou ale nan kan Siryen yo, epi gade byen, pa t gen moun la. <verse eid="2KI 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6"/>Paske SENYÈ a te fè lame Siryen an tande bwi a cha yo avèk bwi cheval yo, son a yon gwo lame, jiskaske yo te di youn ak lòt: “Men gade, wa Israël la gen tan mete an sèvis kont nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:29">I Wa 10:29</ref></char></note>wa Etyen yo avèk wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:1">És 31:1</ref></char></note>Ejipsyen yo pou yo vini sou nou.” <verse eid="2KI 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7"/>Pou sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:4-6">Sòm 48:4-6</ref></char></note>leve kouri pandan tenèb la t ap pwoche e te kite tant yo avèk cheval yo avèk bourik yo ak kan an, jis jan ke li te ye a pou te sove ale e sove lavi yo. <verse eid="2KI 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8"/>Lè moun lalèp sa yo te rive nan landwa kan an, yo te antre nan yon tant pou te manje ak bwè e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:21">Jos 7:21</ref></char></note>pote soti la, ajan avèk lò avèk rad pou te ale sere yo. Epi yo te tounen antre nan yon lòt tant pou te pote soti la tou pou te ale sere yo. <verse eid="2KI 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9"/>Men konsa, yo te pale youn ak lòt: “Nou pa fè byen. Jou sa a se yon jou bòn nouvèl, men nou rete an silans. Si nou tann jis rive maten an, pinisyon va vin rive sou nou. Alò, pou sa, annou ale pale moun lakay wa a.”<verse eid="2KI 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10"/>Konsa, yo te antre e yo te rele gadyen pòtay lavil yo pou te pale yo e te di: “Nou te rive nan kan Siryen yo e vwala, pa t gen moun la, ni menm vwa a yon moun, men sèlman cheval ki te mare ak bourik mare e tant yo menm jan yo te ye.”<verse eid="2KI 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11"/>Gadyen pòtay yo te rele pale anndan kay wa a.<verse eid="2KI 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12"/>Wa a te leve nan lannwit lan e li te di a sèvitè li yo: “Mwen va pale ou koulye a sa ke Siryen yo gen tan fè. Yo konnen ke nou grangou; pou sa, yo te kite kan an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:4-12">Jos 8:4-12</ref></char></note>pou kache yo menm nan chan an. Y ap di: ‘Lè yo sòti lavil la, nou va kaptire yo vivan e antre nan vil la.’”<verse eid="2KI 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13"/>Youn nan sèvitè li yo te di: “Souple, kite kèk moun pran senk nan cheval ki rete lavil la. Gade byen, malgre nenpòt nan yo va menm jan ak tout rès foul moun ki rete ladann nan. Gade byen, yo tankou tout foul ki gen tan peri deja. Pou sa, annou voye gade.”<verse eid="2KI 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14"/>Konsa, yo te pran de cha avèk cheval e wa a te voye yo dèyè lame Siryen an, e te di: “Ale gade.”<verse eid="2KI 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15"/>Yo te ale dèyè yo jis rive nan Jourdain an, e gade, tout chemen an te ranpli avèk rad ak ekipaj ke Siryen yo te jete nan sove ale. Alò, mesaje yo te retounen pou te pale wa a. <verse eid="2KI 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16"/>Konsa, pèp la te sòti e te piyaje kan Siryen an. Alò, yon mezi farin fen te vann pou yon sik e de mezi lòj pou yon sik, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:1">II Wa 7:1</ref></char></note>selon pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17"/>Alò, wa a te chwazi menm ofisye wayal la, sou men a sila li te konn apiye a, pou pran chaj pòtay la; men pèp la te foule li anba pye nan pòtay la e li te vin mouri jis jan ke nonm Bondye a te pale a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:32">II Wa 6:32</ref></char></note>ki t ap pale pandan wa a te vin desann kote l la. <verse eid="2KI 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18"/>Li te vin rive jis jan ke nonm Bondye a te pale a wa a, lè l te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:1">II Wa 7:1</ref> </char></note>“De mezi lòj pou yon sik e yon mezi farin fen pou yon sik, va vann demen vè lè sa a nan pòtay Samarie.” <verse eid="2KI 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19"/>Epi ofisye wayal la te reponn nonm Bondye a e te di: “Alò gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:2">II Wa 7:2</ref></char></note>Si SENYÈ a ta fè fenèt nan syèl la, èske yon bagay konsa ta kab rive?” Epi li te di: “Gade byen, ou va wè li avèk pwòp zye pa ou, men ou p ap manje ladann.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20"/>Epi se konsa sa te vin rive li, paske pèp la te foule li anba pye nan pòtay la, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="2KI 7:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1"/>Alò, Élisée te pale ak fanm a fis ki te geri a. Li te di: “Leve ale avèk tout lakay ou e ale viv nenpòt kote ou kab ale viv; paske SENYÈ a te deklare yon gwo grangou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:27-54">Jen 41:27-54</ref> </char></note>sa va rive menm sou peyi a pandan sèt ane.”<verse eid="2KI 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2"/>Konsa, fanm nan te leve e te fè selon pawòl a nonm Bondye a. Li te ale avèk lakay li pou te vin viv nan peyi Filisten yo pandan sèt ane. <verse eid="2KI 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3"/>Nan fen sèt ane yo, fanm nan te retounen soti nan peyi Filisten yo. Konsa, li te soti deyò pou fè demann a wa a pou lakay li avèk chan li. <verse eid="2KI 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4"/>Alò, wa a t ap pale avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:12">II Wa 4:12</ref></char></note>Guéhazi, sèvitè a nonm Bondye a, e li t ap di: “Souple, fè m konnen tout gran bagay ke Élisée te konn fè yo.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5"/>Pandan li t ap pale wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:35">II Wa 4:35</ref></char></note>ki jan li te restore lavi a sila ki te mouri an, men vwala, fanm a fis ke li te resisite a, te fè demann nan pou afè chan pa li a. Epi Guéhazi te di: “Mèt mwen, wa a, sa se fanm nan e sa se fis li a, ke Elisée te restore lavi a.”<verse eid="2KI 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6"/>Lè wa a te mande fanm nan, li te pale li sa a. Konsa, wa a te chwazi pou li yon sèten ofisye, e li te di: “Restore a li menm tout sa ki te pou li, ak tout pwodwi a chan li soti jou ke li te kite tè a jis rive koulye a.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7"/>Konsa, Élisée te vin Damas. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:24">II Wa 6:24</ref> </char></note>Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, te malad. Yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:20">II Wa 5:20</ref></char></note>“Nonm Bondye a gen tan rive isit la.”<verse eid="2KI 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8"/>Wa a te di a Hazaël: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:3">I Wa 14:3</ref></char></note>“Pran yon kado nan men ou pou ale rankontre nonm Bondye a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:2">II Wa 1:2</ref></char></note>mande a SENYÈ a selon li menm. Mande l: ‘Èske mwen va refè de maladi sa a?’”<verse eid="2KI 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9"/>Konsa, Hazaël te ale rankontre li avèk yon kado nan men l, menm de tout kalite bon bagay Damas, pote sou karant chaj chamo. Li te vin rive kanpe devan li e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:13">II Wa 5:13</ref></char></note>“Fis ou Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, te voye mwen kote ou. Li te vle m mande pou li: ‘Èske mwen va refè de maladi sa a?’”<verse eid="2KI 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10"/>Alò, Élisée te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:14">II Wa 8:14</ref></char></note>“Ale pale li konsa, ‘Ou va asireman refè;’ men SENYÈ a te montre mwen ke byensi, l ap mouri.’” <verse eid="2KI 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11"/>Li te gade l byen fiks, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:17">II Wa 2:17</ref></char></note>jiskaske li te wont. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:41">Luc 19:41</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye a te kriye.<verse eid="2KI 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12"/>Hazaël te di: “Poukisa mèt mwen ap kriye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Alò, li te reponn: “Paske mwen konnen mal la ke ou va fè a fis Israël yo: Fòterès ke ou va brile ak jennonm pa yo ke ou va touye avèk nepe, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:16">II Wa 15:16</ref></char></note>pitit pa yo ke ou va kraze an mòso ak fanm gwo vant yo ke ou va chire nèt.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13"/>Epi Hazaël te di li: “Men kisa sèvitè ou ye? Yon chen ki ta fè gwo bagay sa a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Élisée te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:15">I Wa 19:15</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a te montre mwen ke ou va wa sou Syrie.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14"/>Konsa, li te pati kite Élisée pou te retounen kote mèt li, ki te mande l: “Se kisa ke Élisée te di ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:14">Epi li te reponn: “Li te di mwen ke ou ta asireman vin refè.”<verse eid="2KI 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15"/>Nan jou swivan an, li te pran yon gwo kouvèti a, li te fonse l nan dlo e li te ouvri li sou figi li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:10">II Wa 8:10</ref></char></note>jiskaske wa a te mouri. Konsa, Hazaël te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16"/>Alò, nan senkyèm ane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:17">II Wa 1:17</ref></char></note>Joram, fis a Achab la, wa Israël la, pandan Josaphat te wa Juda, Joram, fis Josaphat la, wa Juda, te devni wa. <verse eid="2KI 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17"/>Li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:5-10">II Kwo 21:5-10</ref></char></note> laj a trann-dezan lè li te devni wa, e li te renye uitan nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18"/>Li te mache nan chemen a wa Israël yo, jis jan ke lakay Achab te fè a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:27">II Wa 8:27</ref></char></note>fi Achab la te devni madanm li. Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19"/>Sepandan, SENYÈ a pa t gen volonte pou detwi Juda, pou koz David, sèvitè li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-15">II Sam 7:12-15</ref></char></note>paske li te pwomèt li pou ba li toujou yon lanp a li menm pa fis li yo pou tout tan.<verse eid="2KI 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20"/>Nan jou pa li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:47">I Wa 22:47</ref></char></note>Édom te fè rebèl soti anba men Juda e yo te fè yon wa sou pwòp tèt pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21"/>Epi Joram te travèse kote Tsaïr e tout cha li yo avèk li. Li te leve nan lannwit pou te frape Edomit ki te antoure li avèk kapitèn a cha yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:17">II Sam 16:17</ref></char></note>men lame pa li a te sove ale rive nan tant pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:40">Jen 27:40</ref></char></note>Konsa, Édom te fè rebèl kont Juda jis rive jodi a. Alò, Libna te revòlte nan menm lè a. <verse eid="2KI 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23"/>Tout lòt zèv a Joram yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a wa a Juda yo? <verse eid="2KI 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:1-7">II Kwo 21:1-7</ref></char></note>Joram te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e li te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan vil David la. Epi Achazia te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25"/>Nan douzyèm ane Joram, fis a Achab la, wa Israël, Achazia, fis a Joram nan te kòmanse renye. <verse eid="2KI 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:2">II Kwo 22:2</ref></char></note>Achazia te gen venn-dezan lè l te devni wa e li te renye yon ane nan Jérusalem. Manman li te rele Athalie, pitit a pitit Omri, wa Israël la. <verse eid="2KI 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27"/>Achazia te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:3">II Kwo 22:3</ref></char></note>mache nan chemen lakay Achab e te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a tankou lakay Achab, akoz se te bofis a lakay Achab.<verse eid="2KI 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28"/>Alò, li te ale avèk Joram, fis a Achab la pou fè lagè kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:15">II Wa 8:15</ref> </char></note>Hazaël, wa Syrie a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:3-29">I Wa 22:3-29</ref></char></note>Ramoth-Galaad e Siryen yo te blese Joram. <verse eid="2KI 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:15">II Wa 9:15</ref></char></note>Wa Joram te retounen nan Jizréel pou geri akoz blesi ke Siryen yo te ba li nan Rama a lè li te goumen kont Hazaël, wa Syrie a. Epi Achazia, fis a Joram nan, wa Juda a, te desann wè Joram, fis Achab la nan Jizréel akoz li te malad la.<verse eid="2KI 8:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1"/>Alò, Élisée, pwofèt la, te rele youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:3">II Wa 2:3</ref></char></note>fis a pwofèt yo. Li te di li: “Mare senti ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:1">I Sam 10:1</ref></char></note>pran bokal lwil nan men ou pou monte Ramoth-Galaad. <verse eid="2KI 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2"/>Lè ou rive la, chache jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:16-17">I Wa 19:16-17</ref></char></note>Jéhu, fis a Josaphat a, fis a Nimschi a. Antre ladann, mande li vin apa de frè li yo. Mennen li nan yon chanm anndan. <verse eid="2KI 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3"/>Konsa, pran bokal lwil la, vide li sou tèt li e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:7">II Kwo 22:7</ref></char></note> “Mwen te onksyone ou wa sou Israël.”’ Epi konsa, louvri pòt la, kouri sove ale! Pa tann!”<verse eid="2KI 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1">II Wa 9:1</ref></char></note>jennonm nan, sèvitè pwofèt la, te ale Ramoth-Galaad. <verse eid="2KI 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5"/>Lè l rive, men vwala, kapitèn a lame yo te chita. Li te di: “Mwen gen yon pawòl pou ou O kapitèn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Jéhu te reponn: “Pou kilès nan nou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Li te di: “Pou ou, O kapitèn.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6"/>Li te leve pou antre nan kay la. Li te vide lwil sou tèt li e te di li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:7-8">I Sam 2:7-8</ref></char></note> Mwen te onksyone ou Wa sou pèp SENYÈ a, sou Israël menm. <verse eid="2KI 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7"/>Ou gen pou frape lakay Achab, mèt ou a, pou Mwen kapab fè revandikasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:4">I Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>san a sèvitè mwen yo, pwofèt yo ak san a tout sèvitè SENYÈ yo, pa men Jézabel. <verse eid="2KI 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8"/>‘Paske tout lakay Achab va peri e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:21">I Wa 21:21</ref></char></note>Mwen va koupe retire sou Achab tout gason, ni esklav, ni lib an Israël. <verse eid="2KI 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10-11">I Wa 14:10-11</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lakay Achab vin tankou lakay Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:3-12">I Wa 16:3-12</ref></char></note>tankou lakay Basha, fis Achija a. <verse eid="2KI 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">I Wa 21:23</ref></char></note>Chen ap manje Jézabel nan teritwa Jizréel la, e nanpwen moun k ap antere li.’” Konsa, li te ouvri pòt la e te sove ale.<verse eid="2KI 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11"/>Alò Jéhu te sòti deyò kote sèvitè mèt li yo. Youn nan yo te mande l: “Èske tout bagay byen? Poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:26">Jr 29:26</ref></char></note>nonm fou sila a te vin kote ou a?” Li te reponn yo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">“Ou konnen nonm sila a avèk tout sa li pale yo.”<verse eid="2KI 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12"/>Yo te di:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">“Sa se manti. Pale nou koulye a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Li te di: “Li te di m, ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Mwen te onksyone ou wa sou Israël”’”.<verse eid="2KI 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:7-8">Mat 21:7-8</ref></char></note>yo te fè vit, chak moun te pran vètman pa yo, te plase yo anba li sou mach la. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:34-39">I Wa 1:34-39</ref></char></note>soufle twonpèt la e yo t ap di: “Jéhu se wa a!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14"/>Konsa Jéhu, fis a Josaphat a, fis a Nimschi a, te fè konplo kont Joram. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:3">I Wa 22:3</ref></char></note>Alò, Joram avèk tout Israël t ap defann Ramoth-Galaad kont Hazaël, wa Syrie a. <verse eid="2KI 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:29">II Wa 8:29</ref></char></note>Wa Joram te fin retounen a Jizréel pou geri akoz blesi ke Siryen yo te ba li lè li te goumen avèk Hazaël, wa Syrie a. Konsa, Jéhu te di: “Si sa se volonte ou, pa kite pèsòn chape kite vil la pou ale pale Jizréel.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16"/>Alò, Jéhu te monte yon cha pou te ale Jizréel, paske Joram te kouche la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:29">II Wa 8:29</ref></char></note>Achazia, wa Juda a, te deja desann pou wè Joram. <verse eid="2KI 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17"/>Koulye a, gadyen an te kanpe sou fò Jizréel, e li te wè konpanyen Jéhu, pandan li t ap vini. Li te di: “Mwen wè yon konpanyen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Joram te di: “Pran yon chevalye, voye li rankontre yo e kite li di: ‘Èske sa an pè?’”<verse eid="2KI 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18"/>Konsa, yon chevalye te ale rankontre li. Li te di: “Konsa pale wa a: ‘Èske sa an pè?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Jéhu te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:19-22">II Wa 9:19-22</ref></char></note>“Kisa ou gen pou fè avèk lapè? Vire dèyè mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Konsa, gadyen an te bay rapò a. “Mesaje a te rive kote yo, men li pa t retounen.”<verse eid="2KI 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19"/>Li te voye yon dezyèm chevalye, ki te rive kote yo. Li te di: “Konsa pale wa a: ‘Èske sa an pè?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Jéhu te reponn: “Kisa ou gen pou fè avèk lapè? Vire dèyè mwen.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20"/>Gadyen an te bay rapò a: “Lè te rive kote yo menm, men li pa t retounen, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:27">II Sam 18:27</ref></char></note>kondwi li se tankou kondwi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:17">I Wa 19:17</ref></char></note>Jéhu, paske li kondwi tankou moun anraje.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21"/>Konsa, Joram te di: “Fè cha a vin parèt.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:21">Epi yo te prepare cha li a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:7">II Kwo 22:7</ref></char></note>Joram, wa Israël la, avèk Achazia, wa Juda a te sòti yo chak nan cha pa yo, yo te ale rankontre Jéhu, e yo te twouve li sou tèren Naboth la, Jizreyelit la. <verse eid="2KI 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22"/>Lè Joram te wè Jéhu, li te di: “Èske sa an pè, Jéhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Epi li te reponn: “Ki lapè sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:30-33">I Wa 16:30-33</ref></char></note>kòmsi zak pwostitiye manman ou Jézabel avèk vye maji pa li yo tèlman anpil?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23"/>Alò, Joram te frennen cha a, tou vire e te sove ale. Li te pale Achazia: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:14">II Wa 11:14</ref></char></note>“Trayizon, O Achazia!”<verse eid="2KI 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:34">I Wa 22:34</ref></char></note>Jéhu te rale banza li ak tout fòs e te tire Joram antre bwa li. Flèch la te pase nan kè l e li te bese desann nan cha li. <verse eid="2KI 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25"/>Alò, Jéhu te pale ak Bidqar, adjwen li an: “Pran l e jete l nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:1">I Wa 21:1</ref></char></note>chan Naboth la, Jizreyelit la, paske mwen sonje lè ou avèk mwen te monte kouri ansanm dèyè Achab, papa li, ke SENYÈ a te pwononse pawòl sa a kont li: <verse eid="2KI 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:13-19">I Wa 21:13-19</ref></char></note>‘Anverite, Mwen te wè ayè, san Naboth la ak san a fis li yo,’ pale SENYÈ a, ‘epi, Mwen va rekonpanse ou nan teren sa a’, pale SENYÈ a. Alò, pou sa, pran l e jete l nan teren an, selon pawòl SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 22:7">II Kwo 22:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè Achazia, wa Juda a te wè li, li te sove ale pa chemen kay jaden an. Epi Jéhu te kouri dèyè li e te di: “Tire li tou, nan cha a.” Konsa, li te fèt sou ti pant Gur a, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:11">Jos 17:11</ref></char></note>Jibleam nan. Men li te sove ale rive Méguiddo, e la li te mouri. <verse eid="2KI 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:30">II Wa 23:30</ref></char></note>Sèvitè li yo te pote li nan yon cha rive Jérusalem e yo te antere li nan tonm pa li avèk zansèt li yo nan vil David la. <verse eid="2KI 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:25">II Wa 8:25</ref></char></note>nan onzyèm ane règn Joram la, fis Achab la, Achazia te devni wa sou Juda.<verse eid="2KI 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30"/>Lè Jéhu te vini Jizréel, Jézabel te tande sa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:30">Jr 4:30</ref></char></note>Li te pentire zye li, li te byen dekore tèt li e li te gade deyò fenèt la. <verse eid="2KI 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31"/>Lè Jéhu te antre nan pòtay la, li menm Jézabel te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:9-20">I Wa 16:9-20</ref></char></note>“Èske tout bagay byen, Zimri, asasen mèt pa w la?”<verse eid="2KI 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32"/>Jéhu te leve figi li vè fenèt la e te di: “Se kilès ki pou mwen? Kilès?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:32">Konsa, de oswa twa linik ren nan te gade anba kote li.<verse eid="2KI 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33"/>Li te di: “Jete li anba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:33">Konsa, yo te jete li anba e kèk nan san li te vòltije jis sou miray la ak sou cheval yo, epi li te foule anba pye yo. <verse eid="2KI 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34"/>Lè Jéhu te antre, li te manje e bwè. Konsa, li te di: “Okipe koulye a de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:25">I Wa 21:25</ref></char></note>fanm modi sila a e antere li; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">I Wa 16:31</ref></char></note>se fi a wa a ke li ye.”<verse eid="2KI 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35"/>Yo te ale antere l, men yo pa t jwenn plis ke zo tèt la, pye yo avèk pla men yo. <verse eid="2KI 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36"/>Pou sa, yo te retounen pou te pale li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:36">Konsa, li te di: “Sa se pawòl SENYÈ a, ke Li te pale pa sèvitè li, Élie, Tichbit la. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">I Wa 21:23</ref></char></note>‘Nan teren Jizréel la, chen yo va manje chè Jézabel, <verse eid="2KI 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:1-3">Jr 8:1-3</ref></char></note>kadav Jézabel va tankou fimye bèt sou sifas chan nan teren Jizréel la, jiskaske yo pa ka di: “Sa se Jézabel.”’”<verse eid="2KI 9:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1"/>Alò, Achab te gen swasann-dis fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:24-29">I Wa 16:24-29</ref></char></note>Samarie. Epi Jéhu te ekri lèt pou te voye Samarie, kote chèf Jizréel yo, ansyen yo e vè gadyen pitit Achab yo, e te di: <verse eid="2KI 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2"/>“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:6">II Wa 5:6</ref></char></note>lè lèt sa a rive kote ou, akoz fis a mèt ou yo avè w, menm jan avèk cha yo, cheval yo ak yon vil fòtifye avèk zam, <verse eid="2KI 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3"/>chwazi pi bon ak pi kapab pami fis a mèt ou yo, mete li sou twòn papa l, e batay pou lakay mèt ou.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4"/>Men yo te pè anpil. Yo te di: “Men gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:24-27">II Wa 9:24-27</ref></char></note>de wa sila yo pa t kanpe devan li! Alò, kijan nou kab kanpe?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5"/>Epi sila ki te sou tout kay la ak sila ki te sou vil la, ansyen yo ak gadyen zanfan yo, te voye kote Jéhu e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:8-11">Jos 9:8-11</ref></char></note>“Nou se sèvitè ou. Tout sa ou mande nou, nou va fè l. Nou p ap fè okenn moun wa. Fè sa ki bon nan zye ou.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6"/>Alò, li te ekri yon lèt yon dezyèm fwa. Li te di: “Si ou sou kote pa m, ou va koute vwa m, pran tèt a mesye yo, fis a mèt ou yo, e vin kote mwen Jizréel demen vè lè sa a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Alò, fis a wa yo, swasann-dis moun, te avèk moun enpòtan ki nan vil yo ki t ap leve yo. <verse eid="2KI 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7"/>Lè lèt la te rive kote yo, yo te pran fis a wa yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:5">Jij 9:5</ref></char></note>touye yo; swasann-dis moun, e te mete tèt pa yo nan panyen pou te voye yo kote li Jizréel. <verse eid="2KI 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8"/>Lè mesaje a te vin pale li, li te di: “Yo gen tan pote tèt a fis a wa yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Li te di yo: “Mete yo nan de pil nan antre pòtay la jis rive nan maten.” <verse eid="2KI 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9"/>Alò, nan maten, li te ale deyò pou te kanpe pale a tout pèp la: “Nou inosan. Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:14-24">II Wa 9:14-24</ref></char></note>mwen te fè konplo kont mèt mwen, e mwen te touye li. Men se kilès ki te touye tout sila yo? <verse eid="2KI 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10"/>Pou sa, konnen byen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:7-10">II Wa 9:7-10</ref></char></note>anyen p ap tonbe atè nan pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale selon lakay Achab la, paske SENYÈ a te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19-29">I Wa 21:19-29</ref></char></note>sa li te pale ak sèvitè li a, Élie.”<verse eid="2KI 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11"/>Konsa, Jéhu te touye tout sila ki te rete lakay Achab nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:4">Os 1:4</ref></char></note>Jizréel yo ak tout moun pwisan pa li yo, avèk sila ki te konnen li yo, avèk prèt li yo, jiskaske pa t gen moun pa l vivan.<verse eid="2KI 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12"/>Epi li te leve sòti ale Samarie. Nan chemen an, pandan li te Beth-Eked ki te pou bèje yo, <verse eid="2KI 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:24-29">II Wa 8:24-29</ref></char></note>Jéhu te rankontre fanmi a Achazia, wa Juda a. Li te mande: “Se kilès nou ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">Yo te reponn: “Nou se fanmi a Achazia. Nou te vin desann pou salye fis a wa yo avèk fis a rèn nan.”<verse eid="2KI 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14"/>Li te di: “Pran yo vivan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:14">Konsa, yo te pran yo vivan e te touye yo nan fòs ki rele Beth-Eked la; karann-de mesye, e li pa t kite youn nan yo.<verse eid="2KI 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15"/>Alò, lè li te kite la, li te rankontre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:6-19">Jr 35:6-19</ref></char></note>Jonadab, fis a Récab ki te vin rankontre li a. Li te salye li, e te di li: “Èske kè ou bon, jan kè m avèk kè ou a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Jonadab te reponn: “Li konsa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Jéhu te di: “Si li konsa, ban mwen men ou.” Epi li te pran li fè l monte nan cha li a. <verse eid="2KI 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16"/>Li te di: “Vini avè m pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">I Wa 19:10</ref></char></note>wè zèl mwen pou SENYÈ a.” Konsa, li te fè li ale nan cha li a. <verse eid="2KI 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17"/>Lè li te rive Samarie, li te touye tout moun ki te rete pou Achab Samarie yo, jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:8">II Wa 9:8</ref></char></note>li te fin detwi li nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:10">II Wa 10:10</ref></char></note>selon pawòl SENYÈ a te pale a Élie a.<verse eid="2KI 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18"/>Konsa, Jéhu te rasanble tout pèp la e li te pale yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31-32">I Wa 16:31-32</ref></char></note>“Achab te sèvi Baal yon tikras; Jéhu va sèvi li anpil. <verse eid="2KI 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">I Wa 18:19</ref></char></note>voye fè parèt tout pwofèt a Baal yo, tout sila ki sèvi l avèk tout prèt li yo. Pa kite youn nan yo pa la. Paske mwen gen yon gran sakrifis pou Baal. Nenpòt moun ki pa la, p ap viv.” Men se avèk riz Jéhu te fè sa, jis pou li ta kapab detwi fidèl a Baal yo.<verse eid="2KI 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20"/>Jéhu te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:14">Jl 1:14</ref></char></note>“Anonse yon fèt sen pou Baal.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:20">Epi yo te anonse l. <verse eid="2KI 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21"/>Konsa, Jéhu te voye toupatou an Israël e tout sèvitè a Baal yo te vini, jis pa t gen yon moun ki rete ki pa t vini. Lè yo te antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:32">I Wa 16:32</ref></char></note>kay Baal la, kay Baal la te ranpli jis sòti nan yon pwent pou rive nan yon lòt pwent. <verse eid="2KI 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22"/>Li te di a sila ki te sou chaj vètman yo: “Mennen vètman yo deyò pou tout sèvitè Baal yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:22">Konsa, li te mennen vètman yo deyò pou yo. <verse eid="2KI 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23"/>Jéhu te antre lakay Baal avèk Jonadab, fis a Récab la, epi li te di a sèvitè Baal yo: “Chache pou wè ke pa gen pami nou okenn nan sèvitè SENYÈ a; men sèlman sèvitè a Baal yo.”<verse eid="2KI 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24"/>Epi yo te antre ladann pou ofri sakrifis avèk ofrann brile. Alò, Jéhu te estasyone pou li, katre-ven òm deyò a, e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:30-42">I Wa 20:30-42</ref></char></note>“Sila ki kite nenpòt nan mesye yo ke m mennen nan men nou yo chape, li menm va bay lavi li an echanj.”<verse eid="2KI 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25"/>Li te vin rive ke depi li te fin fè ofrann brile a, Jéhu te di a gad avèk ofisye wayal yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:40">I Wa 18:40</ref></char></note>“Antre ladann e touye yo! Pa kite pèsòn sòti!” Konsa, yo te touye yo avèk lam nepe, epi gad avèk ofisye wayal yo te jete yo deyò e te antre nan chanm enteryè nan kay Baal la. <verse eid="2KI 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26"/>Yo te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">I Wa 14:23</ref></char></note>pilye sakre lakay Baal yo e te mennen yo deyò pou te brile yo. <verse eid="2KI 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27"/>Anplis, yo te kraze pilye sakre a Baal la, yo te kraze kay Baal la e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:11">Esd 6:11</ref></char></note>fè l tounen yon latrin jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2KI 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28"/>Konsa, Jéhu te rache Baal sòti an Israël.<verse eid="2KI 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">I Wa 12:28-30</ref></char></note>peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche a, depi sila yo, Jéhu pa t kite yo, menm jenn bèf an lò ki te Béthel e ki te Dan. <verse eid="2KI 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30"/>SENYÈ a te di a Jéhu: “Akoz ou te fè sa ki bon nan acheve sa ki bon nan zye m, e ou te fè a lakay Achab selon tout sa ki te nan kè M, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:12">II Wa 15:12</ref></char></note>fis ou yo jis rive nan katriyèm jenerasyon va chita sou twòn Israël la.”<verse eid="2KI 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31"/>Men Jéhu <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:23">Pwov 4:23</ref></char></note>pa t fè atansyon mache avèk tout kè li nan lalwa SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. Li pa t kite peche a Jéroboam yo, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo.<verse eid="2KI 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32"/>Nan jou sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:25">II Wa 13:25</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te kòmanse koupe retire li nan peyi Israël la. Hazaël te bat yo toupatou nan teritwa Israël la, <verse eid="2KI 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33"/>soti nan Jourdain an pou ale vè lès, tout peyi Galaad la, Gadit yo, Ribenit yo ak Manasit yo, soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:36">Det 2:36</ref></char></note>Aroër, ki akote vale Arnon an, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Am 1:3-5</ref></char></note>Galaad avèk Basan. <verse eid="2KI 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jéhu yo ak tout sa li te fè avèk tout pwisans li, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="2KI 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35"/>Konsa, Jéhu te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li Samarie. Joachaz, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36"/>Alò, tan ke Jéhu te renye sou Israël Samarie a se te venn-tuitan.<verse eid="2KI 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1"/>Lè Athalie, manman Achazia te wè ke fis li a te mouri, li te leve detwi tout pitit a fanmi wayal yo. <verse eid="2KI 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2"/>Men Yehoshéba, fi a Wa Joram nan, sè Achazia a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:21">II Wa 11:21</ref></char></note>te pran Joas, fis a Achazia a e li te rachte li pami fis a wa ki t ap mete a lanmò yo, e li te plase li avèk fanm nouris pa li nan chanm dòmi an. Konsa, yo te kache li soti Athalie pou li pa t mete a lanmò. <verse eid="2KI 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3"/>Konsa, li te kache avèk li pandan sizan lakay SENYÈ a, pandan Athalie t ap renye sou peyi a.<verse eid="2KI 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 23:1-21">II Kwo 23:1-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan setyèm ane a, Joïada te voye mennen kapitèn a santèn yo, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:23">II Sam 20:23</ref></char></note>Karyen yo ak nan gad yo. Li te mennen yo kote li lakay SENYÈ a, e li te montre yo fis a wa a. <verse eid="2KI 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5"/>Li te kòmande yo e te di: “Men bagay ke ou oblije fè: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:25">I Kwo 9:25</ref></char></note>yon tyè nan nou, ki vin antre nan Saba a, veye sou lakay wa a; <verse eid="2KI 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6"/>yon tyè tou, nan Pòtay ki rele Sur a, ak yon tyè nan pòtay dèyè gad yo, ki va veye sou kay la kòm defans. <verse eid="2KI 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7"/>De pati ladann nan, tout moun ki sòti nan Saba a, va osi veye sou lakay SENYÈ a pou wa a. <verse eid="2KI 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8"/>Epi nou va antoure wa a, chak moun avèk zam li nan men l; epi nenpòt moun ki antre nan ran pa nou, yo va mete a lanmò. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:16-17">Nonb 27:16-17</ref></char></note>rete avèk wa a lè l sòti ak lè l lantre.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9"/>Konsa, kapitèn a santèn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:8">II Kwo 23:8</ref></char></note>te fè selon tout sa ke Jehojada, prèt la, te kòmande li. Yo chak nan yo te pran mesye pa li yo ki te genyen pou antre nan Saba a, avèk sila ki te gen pou sòti nan Saba yo pou te rive kote Jehojada, prèt la. <verse eid="2KI 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:7">II Sam 8:7</ref></char></note>Prèt la te bay kapitèn a santèn yo lans avèk boukliye, sòti lakay SENYÈ a ki te konn pou Wa David la. <verse eid="2KI 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11"/>Gad yo te kanpe chak avèk zam pa yo nan men yo, soti sou kote dwat kay la, jis rive sou kote goch kay la, akote lotèl la e akote kay la, yo te antoure wa a. <verse eid="2KI 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12"/>Epi li te mennen fè parèt deyò fis a wa a e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:10">II Sam 1:10</ref></char></note>mete kouwòn nan sou tèt li, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16">Egz 25:16</ref> </char></note>temwen an; epi yo te fè li wa e te onksyone li. Yo te bat men yo e te di: “Viv wa a!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 23:12">II Kwo 23:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè Athalie te tande bwi a gad la ak pèp la, li te vin kote moun yo lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14"/>Li te gade, e men vwala, wa a te kanpe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">II Wa 23:3</ref></char></note>akote pilye a, selon koutim nan, avèk kapitèn yo ak twonpèt yo akote wa a. Epi tout moun peyi a t ap rejwi e sone twonpèt yo. Athalie te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:29">Jen 37:29</ref></char></note>chire rad li e te kriye: “Trayizon, Trayizon!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15"/>Jehojada, prèt la, te kòmande kapitèn a santèn ki te chwazi sou lame a. Li te di yo: “Mennen li deyò antre nan ran sòlda yo e nenpòt moun ki swiv li, mete li a lanmò avèk nepe.” Paske prèt la te di: “Pa kite li mete a lanmò nan kay SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16"/>Pou sa, yo te sezi li, lè li te rive kote antre cheval lakay wa yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Jen 9:6</ref></char></note>mete a lanmò la.<verse eid="2KI 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:25">Jos 24:25</ref></char></note>Jehojada te fè yon akò antre SENYÈ a, wa a ak pèp la, pou yo ta devni pèp SENYÈ a, e osi antre pèp la avèk wa a. <verse eid="2KI 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18"/>Tout pèp peyi a te ale kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:26-27">II Wa 10:26-27</ref></char></note>kay Baal la, yo te chire li. Lotèl li ak imaj li yo, yo te kraze an mòso nèt, e yo te touye Matthan, prèt Baal la, devan lotèl yo. Prèt la te chwazi ofisye yo sou kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19"/>Li te pran kapitèn a santèn yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:4">II Wa 11:4</ref></char></note>Karyen yo, avèk gad yo ak tout pèp peyi a. Konsa, yo te mennen wa a desann soti lakay SENYÈ a e yo te vini pa chemen pòtay gad yo rive lakay wa a. Epi li te chita sou twòn a wa yo. <verse eid="2KI 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:10">Pwov 11:10</ref></char></note>tout pèp peyi a te rejwi e vil la te vin kalm. Paske yo te mete Athalie a lanmò pa nepe a lakay wa a. <verse eid="2KI 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:1-14">II Kwo 24:1-14</ref></char></note>Joas te genyen laj sèt ane lè l te vin wa a.<verse eid="2KI 11:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1"/>Nan setyèm ane Jéhu, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:1">II Kwo 24:1</ref></char></note>Joas te vin wa a, e li te renye karantan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Tsibja nan Beer-Schéba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2"/>Joas te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a pandan tout jou li yo depi Jehojada, prèt la, te enstwi li. <verse eid="2KI 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3"/>Sèlman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:4">II Wa 14:4</ref></char></note>wo plas yo pa t retire. Pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis e te brile lansan sou wo plas yo.<verse eid="2KI 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4"/>Alò, Joas te di a prèt yo: “Tout lajan de afè konsakre yo, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:4">II Wa 22:4</ref></char></note>pote antre nan kay SENYÈ a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13-16">Egz 30:13-16</ref></char></note>lajan aktyèl la, lajan ranmase kòm devwa a chak mesye ak tout sa ke kè a yon moun ta pouse li pote lakay SENYÈ a; <verse eid="2KI 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5"/>kite prèt yo pran li pou yo menm, yo chak nan men a moun yo konnen. Epi yo va sèvi li pou repare donmaj nan kay la, nenpòt kote yon donmaj ta twouve.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6"/>Men li vin rive ke nan venn-twazan pouvwa a Wa Joas la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:5">II Kwo 24:5</ref></char></note>prèt yo pa t ankò repare donmaj kay la. <verse eid="2KI 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7"/>Alò, Joas te rele Jehojada, prèt la ak lòt prèt yo, e li te pale yo konsa: “Poukisa ou pa repare donmaj kay la? Alò, pou koz sa a, pa pran kòb ankò nan men moun pa w yo, men pito livre li pou repare donmaj kay la.”<verse eid="2KI 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8"/>Pou sa, prèt yo te dakò pou yo pa t pran lajan nan men pèp la, ni fè reparasyon kay la. <verse eid="2KI 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:41">Mc 12:41</ref></char></note> Jehojada, prèt la te pran yon kès sere e te pèse yon twou nan tèt bwat la e te mete li akote lotèl la sou kote dwat kote moun antre nan kay SENYÈ a. Epi prèt ki te veye kote papòt la, te mete ladann tout lajan ki te mennen nan kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10"/>Lè yo te wè ke anpil lajan te nan kès la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:17">II Sam 8:17</ref></char></note>grefye a wa a avèk wo prèt la te vin monte, te mare li nan sak yo e te konte lajan ki te twouve nan kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11"/>Yo te bay lajan ki te peze a, mete nan men a sila ki t ap fè travay yo, ki te responsab nan kay SENYÈ a. Konsa, yo menm te vèse bay li kòm pèyman a chapant avèk ouvriye ki t ap fè zèv travay la nan kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12"/>Anplis yo te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:5">II Wa 22:5</ref></char></note>a mason yo avèk sila ki t ap taye wòch yo, pou achte gwo bwa avèk wòch taye pou repare donmaj kay SENYÈ a ak tout sa ki te dispoze pou reparasyon li an. <verse eid="2KI 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13"/>Men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:14">II Kwo 24:14</ref></char></note>pa t fè pou lakay SENYÈ a, anyen an ajan, tas yo, etennwa yo, bòl yo, twonpèt yo, ni veso an lò yo, ni veso an ajan yo avèk lajan ki te mennen antre lakay SENYÈ a; <verse eid="2KI 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14"/>paske yo te bay lajan sa a a sila ki te fè travay yo, e avèk li yo te repare lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:7">II Wa 22:7</ref></char></note>yo pa t egzije yon kontwòl kontab nan men mesye ke yo te mete lajan pou peye sila ki te fè travay yo, paske yo te fidèl. <verse eid="2KI 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16"/>Lajan ofrann koupab la avèk lajan ofrann peche a pa t antre lakay SENYÈ a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:7">Lev 7:7</ref></char></note>Li te pou prèt yo.<verse eid="2KI 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17"/>Alò, Hazaël, wa Syrie a, te monte goumen kont Gath e te kaptire li. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:23-24">II Kwo 24:23-24</ref></char></note>Hazaël te mete figi li vè Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:26">I Wa 14:26</ref></char></note>Joas, wa Juda a, te pran tout bagay sen ke Josaphat, Joram, ak Achazia, zansèt li yo te konsakre yo ak afè sen pa li yo ak tout lò ki te twouve pami trezò lakay SENYÈ a e li te voye yo bay wa Hazaël, wa Syrie a. Epi Hazaël te kite Jérusalem.<verse eid="2KI 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Joas yo avèk tout sa li te fè, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda yo? <verse eid="2KI 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:25-27">II Kwo 24:25-27</ref></char></note>Sèvitè li yo te leve fè yon konplo e te frape Joas lakay Millo a pandan li t ap desann kite Silla. <verse eid="2KI 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21"/>Paske Jozabad, fis a Shomer a, avèk Yehozabad, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:26">II Kwo 24:26</ref></char></note> Schimeath a, sèvitè li yo, te frape li e li te mouri. Yo te antere li avèk zansèt li yo nan vil David la e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:1">II Wa 14:1</ref></char></note>Amatsia, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1"/>Nan venn-twazyèm ane a Joas la, fis a Achazia a, wa Juda a, te devni wa sou Israël nan Samarie, e li te renye pandan di-setan. <verse eid="2KI 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2"/>Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a e li te swiv peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:26-33">I Wa 12:26-33</ref></char></note>avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo. Li pa t vire kite yo menm. <verse eid="2KI 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:14">Jij 2:14</ref> </char></note>Akoz sa, lakòlè SENYÈ a te limen kont Israël, e Li te livre yo nan men a Hazaël, wa Syrie a ak nan men a Ben-Hadad, fis a Hazaël la. <verse eid="2KI 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:7-9">Nonb 21:7-9</ref></char></note>Joachaz te sipliye SENYÈ a pou fè li favè, e SENYÈ a te koute li; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7-9">Egz 3:7-9</ref></char></note>Li te wè opresyon Israël la, jan Syrie t ap oprime yo. <verse eid="2KI 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5"/>SENYÈ a te bay Israël yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:25">II Wa 13:25</ref></char></note>liberatè. Konsa, yo te chape anba men Siryen yo. Konsa, fis Israël yo te viv nan tant yo, kòm oparavan. <verse eid="2KI 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6"/>Sepandan, yo pa t vire kite peche lakay Jéroboam yo, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo, men li te mache nan yo; epi zidòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:33">I Wa 16:33</ref></char></note>Astarté a te toujou kanpe Samarie. <verse eid="2KI 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7"/>Pou sa, Li te kite pou Joachaz yon lame ki pa t plis ke senkant chevalye avèk dis cha e di-mil sòlda apye; paske wa Syrie a te detwi yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:3">Am 1:3</ref></char></note>fè yo vin tankou pousyè vannen. <verse eid="2KI 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8"/>Alò tout lòt zèv a Joachaz yo, avèk tout sa li te fè ak pouvwa li, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv La A Kwonik Yo A Wa Israël Yo? <verse eid="2KI 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9"/>Epi Joachaz te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li Samarie. Epi Joas, fis li a, te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10"/>Nan trann-setyèm ane a Joas, wa Juda a, Joas, fis a Joachaz la te devni wa sou Israël Samarie e te renye pandan sèzan. <verse eid="2KI 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a; li pa t vire kite tout peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo; men li te mache ladan yo. <verse eid="2KI 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:14-19">II Wa 13:14-19</ref></char></note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Joas yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè ak pouvwa li, avèk sila li te goumen kont Amatsia, wa Juda a, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv A Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo? <verse eid="2KI 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13"/>Konsa, Joas te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e Jéroboam te chita sou twòn li an. Epi Joas te antere Samarie avèk wa Israël yo.<verse eid="2KI 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14"/>Lè Élisée te vin malad avèk maladi ki te pran lavi li a, Joas, wa Israël la, te desann kote li, e te kriye sou li e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:12">II Wa 2:12</ref></char></note>“Papa mwen, O Papa mwen, men cha Israël yo avèk chevalye li yo!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15"/>Élisée te di li: “Pran yon banza avèk flèch.” Konsa, li te pran yon Banza avèk flèch. <verse eid="2KI 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16"/>Alò, li te di a wa Israël la: “Mete men ou sou banza a.” Epi li te mete men l sou li e Élisée te mete men l sou men wa a. <verse eid="2KI 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17"/>Li te di: “Ouvri fenèt la vè lès!” Epi li te ouvri li. Alò, Élisée te di: “Tire!” Epi li te tire. Epi li te di: “Flèch viktwa SENYÈ a, menm flèch viktwa sou Syrie a; paske ou va bat Siryen yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:26">I Wa 20:26</ref></char></note>Aphek jiskaske ou fin detwi yo.”<verse eid="2KI 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18"/>Epi li te di: “Pran flèch yo!” Epi li te pran yo. Li te di a wa Israël la: “Frape tè a!” Epi li te frape li twa fwa e te sispann. <verse eid="2KI 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:20">II Wa 5:20</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye a te fache avèk li e te di: “Ou te dwe frape l senk oswa sis fwa; epi konsa, ou t ap frape Syrie jiskaske ou fin detwi li. Men koulye a, se sèlman twa fwa ke ou va frape Syrie.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20"/>Élisée te mouri e yo te antere li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:7">II Wa 3:7</ref></char></note>bann Moabit yo te fè envazyon teritwa a nan sezon prentan ane sila a. <verse eid="2KI 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21"/>Pandan yo t ap antere yon mesye, men vwala, yo te wè yon bann piyajè; epi yo te jete mesye a nan tonm Élisée a. Epi lè mesye a te touche zo Élisée yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:52">Mat 27:52</ref></char></note>resisite e te kanpe sou pye l.<verse eid="2KI 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:12-13">II Wa 8:12-13</ref></char></note>Hazaël, wa Syrie a, te oprime Israël pandan tout jou a Joachaz yo. <verse eid="2KI 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:27">II Wa 14:27</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te fè yo gras, Li te gen mizerikòd pou yo, Li te vire kote yo akoz akò ke li te gen avèk Abraham, Isaac, avèk Jacob la e Li pa t detwi yo ni jete yo deyò prezans li jis rive nan moman sa a.<verse eid="2KI 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24"/>Lè Hazaël, wa Syrie a te mouri, Ben-Hadad, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25"/>Epi Joas, fis a Joachaz la, te reprann vil yo soti nan men a Ben-Hadad, fis Hazaël la, vil ke papa li te pran nan lagè soti nan men a Joachaz yo, papa li a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:18-19">II Wa 13:18-19</ref></char></note> Twa fwa Joas te bat li e te reprann vil yo ki te pou Israël yo.<verse eid="2KI 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 25:1">II Kwo 25:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan dezyèm ane Joas la, fis a Joachaz la, wa Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:10">II Wa 13:10</ref></char></note>Amatsia, fis a Joas la, wa Juda a, te devni wa. <verse eid="2KI 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2"/>Li te gen laj a venn-senkan lè li te devni wa, e li te renye vent-nèf ane Jérusalem. Manman li te rele Joaddan, yon moun Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3"/>Amatsia te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a, men pa tankou David, zansèt li a. Li te fè menm selon tout sa ke Joas, papa li te konn fè yo. <verse eid="2KI 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4"/>Se sèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">II Wa 12:3</ref></char></note>wo plas yo ki pa t retire. Pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis e brile lansan nan wo plas yo. <verse eid="2KI 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke depi wayòm nan te byen solid nan men l, ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:20">II Wa 12:20</ref></char></note>touye sèvitè li yo ki te touye wa a, papa li. <verse eid="2KI 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6"/>Men fis a sila ki te mouri yo, li pa t mete yo a lanmò, an akò avèk sa ki ekri nan liv Lalwa Moïse la, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande a lè l te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Det 24:16</ref></char></note>“Papa yo p ap mete a lanmò pou fis yo, ni fis yo p ap mete a lanmò pou papa yo, men chak moun va mete a lanmò pou pwòp peche pa l.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7"/>Li te touye di-mil moun Édom nan Vale Sèl la, epi te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:1">És 16:1</ref></char></note>Séla nan lagè. Li te rele li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:38">Jos 15:38</ref></char></note>Yoqthéel, e se sa li ye jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2KI 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:17-24">II Kwo 25:17-24</ref></char></note>Epi Amatsia te voye mesaje yo kote Joas, fis a Joachaz la, fis a Jéhu a, wa a Israël la. Li te di: “Vini, annou parèt fasafas.”<verse eid="2KI 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9"/>Joas, wa Israël la, te voye kote Amatsia, wa Juda a, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:8-15">Jij 9:8-15</ref></char></note>“Bwa pikan ki te Liban an te voye kote sèd ki te Liban an, e li te di: ‘Bay fi ou an maryaj a fis mwen an.’ Men te pase pa la yon bèt sovaj ki te Liban, e li te kraze bwa pikan an anba pye l. <verse eid="2KI 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:7">II Wa 14:7</ref></char></note>Anverite, ou te bat Édom e kè ou vin plen ògèy. Rete lakay ou pou fè kè kontan. Pou ki rezon ou ta pwovoke twoub la jiskaske ou menm, ou ta tonbe, e Juda ansanm avèk ou?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11"/>Men Amatsia te refize koute. Pou sa, wa Israël la te monte. Li menm avèk wa Juda a te parèt fasafas nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:38">Jos 19:38</ref></char></note>Beth-Schémesch ki pou Juda a. <verse eid="2KI 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12"/>Juda te bat pa Israël e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:17">II Sam 18:17</ref></char></note>yo te sove ale, yo chak nan pwòp tant pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13"/>Epi Joas, wa Israël la, te kaptire Amatsia, wa Juda a, fis a Joas la, fis a Achazia a, nan Beth-Schémesch, li te rive Jérusalem e li te chire miray Jérusalem nan soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:16">Né 8:16</ref></char></note>Pòtay Ephraïm nan jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:23">II Kwo 25:23</ref></char></note>Pòtay Kwen an, distans a kat-san koude. <verse eid="2KI 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:26">I Wa 14:26</ref></char></note>Li te pran tout lò avèk tout ajan ak tout zouti ki te twouve lakay SENYÈ a, nan trezò lakay wa a, ansanm ak kaptif yo e li te retounen Samarie.<verse eid="2KI 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 13:12-13">II Wa 13:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout lòt zèv ke Joas te fè yo, avèk pwisans li, ak jan li te goumen avèk Amatsia, wa Juda a, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv A Kwonik A Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="2KI 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16"/>Konsa, Joas te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere Samarie avèk wa Israël yo. Jéroboam, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 25:25-28">II Kwo 25:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amatsia, fis a Joas la, Wa Juda a, te viv kenzan apre lanmò Joas, fis a Joachaz la, wa Israël la. <verse eid="2KI 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Amatsia yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv A Kwonik A Wa A Juda yo? <verse eid="2KI 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19"/>Yo te fè konplo kont li Jérusalem e li te sove ale rive Lakis. Men yo te voye dèyè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:31">Jos 10:31</ref></char></note>Lakis pou te touye li la. <verse eid="2KI 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20"/>Epi yo te mennen kò li sou cheval yo, e li te antere Jérusalem avèk zansèt li yo nan vil David la.<verse eid="2KI 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21"/>Tout pèp Juda a te pran Azaria, nan laj sèzan, e yo te fè li wa nan plas a papa li, Amatsia. <verse eid="2KI 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:26">I Wa 9:26</ref></char></note>Li te bati Élath e li te remèt li bay Juda apre wa a te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo.<verse eid="2KI 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23"/>Nan kenzyèm ane règn Amatsia, fis a Joas la, wa Juda a, Jéroboam, fis a Joas la, wa Israël la te devni wa Samarie, e li te renye pandan karanteyen ane. <verse eid="2KI 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a. Li pa t kite tout peche Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, ki te fè Israël peche yo. <verse eid="2KI 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25"/>Li te restore lizyè Israël la soti nan antre Hamath jis rive nan Lamè Araba, selon pawòl SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, ki te pale pa sèvitè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39-40">Mat 12:39-40</ref></char></note>Jonas, fis a Amitthaï a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:13">Jos 19:13</ref></char></note>Gath-Hépher. <verse eid="2KI 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:4">II Wa 13:4</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te wè soufrans Israël ki te tèlman anmè; paske pa t gen ni esklav, ni lib, ni pa t gen okenn moun ki pou ede Israël. <verse eid="2KI 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:23">II Wa 13:23</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a pa t di ke li ta efase non Israël anba syèl la; men Li te delivre yo pa men Jéroboam, fis a Joas la. <verse eid="2KI 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv Jéroboam yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè ak pouvwa li, jan li te goumen ak jan li te reprann pou Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:24">I Wa 11:24</ref></char></note>Damas avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:3">II Kwo 8:3</ref></char></note>Hamath nan Juda, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo? <verse eid="2KI 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29"/>Epi Jéroboam te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo, menm ak wa a Israël yo. Epi Zacharie, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:17">II Wa 14:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan venn-setyèm ane a Jéroboam, wa Israël la, Azaria, fis a Amatsia a, wa Juda a, te devni wa. <verse eid="2KI 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2"/>Li te gen laj sèzan lè li te devni wa e li te renye pandan senkann-dezan Jérusalem. Non manman l se te Jecolia, moun Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3"/>Azaria te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a, selon tout sa ke papa li, Amatsia te fè. <verse eid="2KI 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4"/>Sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">II Wa 12:3</ref></char></note>wo plas yo ki pa t retire. Pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis e brile lansan sou wo plas yo. <verse eid="2KI 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:21-23">II Kwo 26:21-23</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te frape wa a pou l te gen yon lalèp jis rive jou ke li te mouri an. Epi li te viv nan yon kay apa pandan fis a wa a, Jotham te nan kay la, e t ap jije pèp peyi a. <verse eid="2KI 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Azaria yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa A Juda yo? <verse eid="2KI 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7"/>Epi Azaria te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo. Yo te antere li avèk papa li nan vil David la, e Jotham, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:1">II Wa 15:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan tran-tuityèm ane Azaria, wa Juda a, Zacharie, fis a Jéroboam nan te devni wa an Israël nan Samarie pandan si mwa. <verse eid="2KI 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a tankou zansèt li yo te fè. Li pa t kite peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo. <verse eid="2KI 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10"/>Epi Schallum, fis a Jabesch la, te fè konplo kont li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:9">Am 7:9</ref></char></note>frape li devan pèp la pou te touye li e renye nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Zacharie yo, gade byen, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël Yo? <verse eid="2KI 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12"/>Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:30">II Wa 10:30</ref></char></note>pawòl SENYÈ a te pale a Jéhu e te di: “Fis ou yo jis rive nan katriyèm jenerasyon va chita sou twòn Israël la.” Epi se konsa sa te ye.<verse eid="2KI 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13"/>Schallum, fis a Jabesch la te devni wa nan trant-nevyèm ane a Ozias, wa Juda a e li te renye yon mwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:24">I Wa 16:24</ref></char></note>Samarie. <verse eid="2KI 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14"/>Epi Menahem, fis a Gadi a te monte soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:17">I Wa 14:17</ref></char></note>Thirtsa pou te vini Samarie, li te frape Schallum, fis a Jabesch la Samarie e li te touye li pou te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Schallum yo avèk konplo li te fè yo, men vwala, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo?<verse eid="2KI 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16"/>Epi Menahem te frape Thiphsach avèk tout moun ladann avèk lizyè li yo soti Thirtsa, akoz yo pa t ouvri pou li; pou sa, li te frape li e chire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:12">II Wa 8:12</ref></char></note>tout fanm li yo ki te ansent.<verse eid="2KI 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-13">II Wa 15:1-13</ref></char></note> trant-nèf ane a Azaria yo, wa Juda a, Menahem, fis a Gadi a, te renye sou Israël pandan dizan Samarie. <verse eid="2KI 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a; li pa t kite pandan tout jou li yo peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebath la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo. <verse eid="2KI 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:25-26">I Kwo 5:25-26</ref></char></note>Pul, wa Assyrie a, te vini kont peyi a e Menahem te bay Pul mil talan ajan pou men li ta kapab avèk li pou ranfòse wayòm nan anba règn pa l la. <verse eid="2KI 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20"/>Alò, Menahem te egzije lajan an nan men Israël, menm a tout mesye enpòtan avèk mwayen, soti nan chak moun senkant sik ajan pou peye wa Assyrie a. Konsa, wa Assyrie a te retounen e pa t rete la nan peyi a. <verse eid="2KI 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21"/>Alò, tout rès zak a Menahem yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo? <verse eid="2KI 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22"/>Epi Menahem te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e Pekachia, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-17">II Wa 15:1-17</ref></char></note>senkyèm ane a Azaria a, wa Juda a, Pekachia, fis a Menahem nan, te devni wa sou Israël nan Samarie e li te renye pandan dezan. <verse eid="2KI 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a; li pa t kite peche a Jéroboam yo, fis Nebat la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo. <verse eid="2KI 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25"/>Alò, Pékach, fis a Remalia a, ofisye pa li a, te fè konplo kont li e te frape li Samarie nan fò kay wa a avèk Argob ak Arié; ansanm ak li, te gen senkant mesye Galaadit yo e li te touye li pou te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Pékach yo avèk tout sa li te fè yo, men gade, yo ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo.<verse eid="2KI 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27"/>Nan senkann-dezyèm ane a Azaria, wa Juda a,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:6">II Kwo 28:6</ref></char></note> Pékach, fis a Remalia a, te devni wa sou Israël nan Samarie e li te renye pandan ventan. <verse eid="2KI 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28"/>Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a; li pa t kite peche a Jéroboam yo, fis Nebath la, avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo. <verse eid="2KI 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29"/>Nan jou a Pékach yo, wa Israël la, Tiglath-Piléser, wa Assyrie a, te parèt e te kaptire Ijjon avèk Abel-Beth-Maaca e Janoach avèk Kédesch, Hatsor, Galaad avèk Galilée ak tout peyi Nephtali a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">II Wa 17:6</ref></char></note>li te pote yo kaptif nan Assyrie. <verse eid="2KI 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30"/>Epi Osée, fis Ela a, te fè yon konplo kont Pékach, fis a Remalia a, li te frape li e te mete li a lanmò pou te devni wa nan plas li, nan ventyèm ane a Jotham, fis a Ozias la. <verse eid="2KI 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Pékach yo avèk tout sa li te fè yo, gade byen, yo ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Israël Yo.<verse eid="2KI 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32"/>Nan dezyèm ane a Pékach la, fis a Remalia a, wa Israël la, Jotham, fis a Ozias la, wa Juda a, te devni wa. <verse eid="2KI 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 27:1">II Kwo 27:1</ref></char></note>Li te gen laj a venn-senkan lè l te devni wa a e li te renye sèzan nan Jérusalem. Non manman li se te Jeruscha, fi a Tsadok la. <verse eid="2KI 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:3-4">II Wa 15:3-4</ref></char></note>Li te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a; li te fè selon tout sa ke papa li, Ozias te fè. <verse eid="2KI 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35"/>Se sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">II Wa 12:3</ref></char></note>wo plas yo ki pa t retire; pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis e brile lansan nan wo plas yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:20">II Kwo 23:20</ref></char></note>Li te bati pòtay pa anwo lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jotham yo avèk tout sa li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37"/>Nan jou sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:5">II Wa 18:5</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te kòmanse voye Retsin, wa Syrie a avèk Pékach, fis a Remalia a kont Juda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38"/>Epi Jotham te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e li te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan lavil David, papa zansèt li a; epi Achaz, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 15:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1"/>Nan di-setyèm ane a Pékach, fis a Remalia a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:1">II Kwo 28:1</ref></char></note>Achaz, fis Jotham nan, wa Juda a, te devni wa. <verse eid="2KI 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2"/>Achaz te gen ventan lè li te devni wa, a e li te renye sèzan nan Jérusalem. Li pa t fè sa ki bon nan zye a SENYÈ a, jan David te konn fè a. <verse eid="2KI 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3"/>Men li te mache nan chemen wa Israël yo. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref> </char></note> menm te fè fis li pase nan dife, tankou abominasyon a nasyon ke SENYÈ a te chase mete deyò devan fis Israël yo. <verse eid="2KI 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4"/>Li te fè sakrifis e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:2">Det 12:2</ref></char></note>li te brile lansan sou wo plas yo ak sou ti mòn anba chak pyebwa vèt yo.<verse eid="2KI 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:1">És 7:1</ref></char></note>Retsin, wa Syrie a avèk Pékach, fis a Remalia a, wa Israël la, te monte Jérusalem pou fè lagè. Yo te fè syèj sou Achaz, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:5">II Kwo 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 28:6">6</ref></char></note>men yo pa t kab venk li. <verse eid="2KI 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6"/>Nan tan sa a Retsin, wa Syrie a, te reprann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:22">I Wa 14:22</ref></char></note>Élath pou Syrie e li te netwaye retire Jwif yo nèt nan Élath. Epi Siryen yo te vini Élath e yo rete la jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2KI 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:18">II Kwo 28:18</ref></char></note>Konsa, Achaz te voye mesaje yo kote Tiglath-Piléser, wa Assyrie a. Li te di: “Mwen se sèvitè ou ak fis ou; vin delivre mwen soti nan men a wa Syrie a, avèk men a wa Israël la k ap fè soulèvman kont mwen.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:17-18">II Wa 12:17-18</ref></char></note>Achaz te pran ajan avèk lò ki te twouve lakay SENYÈ a ak nan kès lakay wa a pou te voye yon kado bay wa Assyrie a. <verse eid="2KI 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9"/>Konsa, wa Assyrie a te koute li, epi wa Assyrie a te monte kont Damas pou te kaptire li. Li te pote pèp li a deyò an egzil nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:6">És 22:6</ref></char></note>Kir, e li te mete Retsin a lanmò.<verse eid="2KI 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10"/>Alò, Wa Achaz te ale kote Damas pou rankontre Tiglath-Piléser, wa Assyrie, e li te wè lotèl ki te Damas la. Konsa, Wa Achaz te voye bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:2">És 8:2</ref></char></note>Urie, prèt la, plan lotèl la avèk yon modèl li, selon tout mendèv pa li. <verse eid="2KI 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11"/>Konsa, Urie, prèt la te bati yon lotèl selon tout sa ke Wa Achaz te voye soti Damas, e konsa Urie, prèt la, te fè li, avan wa Achaz te vini soti Damas. <verse eid="2KI 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12"/>Lè wa a te antre sòti Damas, wa a te wè lotèl la. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16-19">II Kwo 26:16-19</ref></char></note>wa a te pwoche lotèl la e te fè ofrann sou li. <verse eid="2KI 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13"/>Li te brile ofrann brile li a avèk ofrann sereyal la, li te vide ofrann bwason li an e li te flite san a ofrann lapè li yo sou lotèl la. <verse eid="2KI 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Egz 27:1-2</ref></char></note>Lotèl bwonz lan, ki te devan SENYÈ a, li te mennen soti devan kay la, soti nan antre lotèl pa li a, lakay Senyè a e li te mete li sou kote nò lotèl pa li a. <verse eid="2KI 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15"/>Epi Wa Achaz te kòmande Urie, prèt la, e li te di: “Sou gran lotèl la, brile ofrann brile maten an ak ofrann sereyal aswè a; epi ofrann brile wa a avèk ofrann sereyal pa li a, avèk ofrann brile a tout pèp peyi a avèk ofrann sereyal pa yo ak ofrann bwason yo; epi flite sou li tout san a ofrann brile a e tout san a sakrifis la. Men lotèl bwonz lan va sèlman pou mwen pou m kab mande konsèy ladann. <verse eid="2KI 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16"/>Pou sa, Urie, prèt la, te fè tout bagay selon sa ke Wa Achaz te kòmande a.”<verse eid="2KI 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17"/>Alò, Wa Achaz te koupe retire arebò a baz yo e li te retire basen lave a sou yo. Li te osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-25">I Wa 7:23-25</ref></char></note>desann lanmè a soti sou bèf bwonz ki te anba li yo, e li te mete li sou yon pave an wòch. <verse eid="2KI 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18"/>Li te retire osi chemen machpye Saba a ke yo te bati nan kay la e antre eksteryè a wa a, li te retire li soti lakay SENYÈ a akoz wa Assyrie a. <verse eid="2KI 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv Achaz te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:26">II Kwo 28:26</ref></char></note>nan Liv Kwonik A Wa A Juda yo? <verse eid="2KI 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20"/>Konsa, Achaz te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo, e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">És 14:28</ref></char></note>te antere avèk zansèt pa li yo nan lavil David la. Fis li, Ézéchias, te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1"/>Nan douzyèm ane Achaz, wa Juda a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:30">II Wa 15:30</ref></char></note>Osée, fis a Éla a te vin wa sou Israël nan Samarie, e li te renye pandan nèf ane. <verse eid="2KI 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, men pa tankou wa Israël ki te avan li yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3"/>Salmanasar, wa Assyrie a, te monte kont li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:14">Os 10:14</ref></char></note>Osée te devni sèvitè li e te peye li taks obligatwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4"/>Men wa Assyrie a te jwenn konplo nan Osée, ki te konn voye mesaje kote So, wa Égypte la, e li pa t prezante taks a wa Assyrie a jan li te konn fè ane pa ane a. Pou koz sa a, wa Assyrie a te fèmen li nan prizon byen mare. <verse eid="2KI 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5"/>Epi wa Assyrie te fè envazyon tout peyi a e li te monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:16">Os 13:16</ref></char></note>Samarie pou te fè syèj li pandan twazan. <verse eid="2KI 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6"/>Nan nevyèm ane Osée a, wa Assyrie a te kaptire Samarie, li te pote pèp Israël la an egzil nan Assyrie, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:11">II Wa 18:11</ref></char></note>fè yo rete Chalach avèk Chabor sou rivyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:12">És 37:12</ref></char></note>Gozan an ak nan vil a Medi yo.<verse eid="2KI 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:16">Jos 23:16</ref></char></note>sa te vin rive akoz fis Israël yo te peche kont SENYÈ pa yo a ki te mennen fè yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la anba men Farawon, wa Égypte la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:10">Jij 6:10</ref></char></note>Yo te gen lakrent lòt dye yo, <verse eid="2KI 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8"/>epi yo te mache selon koutim a lòt nasyon yo ke SENYÈ a te chase mete deyò devan fis Israël yo nan movèz abitid ke wa Israël yo te etabli yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9"/>Fis Israël yo te fè bagay an sekrè ki pa t bon kont SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a. Anplis, yo te bati pou kont yo wo plas nan tout vil pa yo soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:8">II Wa 18:8</ref></char></note>fò kay gad yo jis rive nan vil fòtifye yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-14">Egz 34:12-14</ref></char></note>Yo te plase pou kont yo pilye sakre yo avèk poto Astarté yo sou chak ti mòn e anba chak pyebwa vèt, <verse eid="2KI 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11"/>epi la, yo te brile lansan sou tout wo plas yo jis jan nasyon ke SENYÈ a te pote fè ale an egzil yo te konn fè avan yo. Yo te fè bagay mal ki te pwovoke SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12"/>Yo te sèvi zidòl, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Egz 20:4</ref></char></note>selon sila SENYÈ a te di yo: “Ou pa pou fè bagay sa a.” <verse eid="2KI 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13"/>Sepandan, SENYÈ a te avèti Israël avèk Juda <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:23">II Wa 17:23</ref></char></note>pa tout pwofèt Li yo ak tout konseye Li. Li te di: “Vire kite move wout sa yo e kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo, règleman Mwen yo, selon tout lalwa a avèk sila Mwen te kòmande zansèt nou yo e ke m te voye bannou pa sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt yo.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14"/>Sepandan, yo pa t koute, men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:9">Egz 32:9</ref></char></note>fè tèt di tankou zansèt pa yo, ki pa t kwè nan SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a. <verse eid="2KI 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15"/>Yo te rejte règleman pa Li yo avèk akò ke Li te fè avèk zansèt pa yo avèk avètisman sa yo, avèk sila li te avèti yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32:21</ref></char></note>yo te swiv foli yo, e yo te vin plen ògèy. Yo te kouri apre nasyon ki te antoure yo, selon sila SENYÈ a te kòmande yo pa fè tankou yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16"/>Yo te bliye nèt tout kòmandman a SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a e yo te fè pou kont yo imaj fonn a ti bèf yo menm, te fè yon Astarté, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Det 4:19</ref></char></note>adore tout lame selès la e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">I Wa 16:31</ref></char></note>sèvi Baal. <verse eid="2KI 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17"/>Konsa, yo te fè fis avèk fi pa yo pase nan dife, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19:26</ref></char></note>pratike divinasyon avèk Wanga e yo te vann pwòp tèt yo pou fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a e pwovoke Li. <verse eid="2KI 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ a te byen fache avèk Israël e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">II Wa 17:6</ref></char></note>retire yo devan zye Li. Okenn moun pa t rete sof tribi Juda a.<verse eid="2KI 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:22-23">I Wa 14:22-23</ref></char></note>Juda pa t kenbe kòmandman SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, men te mache nan koutim ke Israël te etabli yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20"/>SENYÈ a te rejte tout desandan a Israël yo. Li te aflije yo e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">II Wa 15:29</ref></char></note>livre yo nan men a piyajè jiskaske Li te jete yo deyò vizaj Li. <verse eid="2KI 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:11-31">I Wa 11:11-31</ref></char></note>Li te fin chire Israël fè l sòti lakay David la, yo te fè Jéroboam, fis Nebath la, wa. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-33">I Wa 12:28-33</ref></char></note>Jéroboam te bourade kondwi Israël pou l pa swiv SENYÈ a e li te fè yo fè yon gwo peche. <verse eid="2KI 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22"/>Fis a Israël yo te mache nan tout peche ke Jéroboam te fè yo. Yo pa t kite yo <verse eid="2KI 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23"/>jiskaske SENYÈ a te retire Israël soti devan vizaj Li, jan Li te pale pa tout sèvitè Li yo, pwofèt yo. Konsa, Israël te pote lwen an egzil soti nan pwòp peyi pa yo pou Assyrie jis rive jou sa a.<verse eid="2KI 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:2-10">Esd 4:2-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wa a Assyrie a te mennen moun soti Babylone, Cutha, ak Avva pou Hamath, ak Sepharvaïm, e li te etabli yo nan vil Samarie yo pou ranplase fis Israël yo. Konsa, yo te posede Samarie e yo te viv nan vil pa li yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25"/>Lè yo te kòmanse viv la, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:32-41">II Wa 17:32-41</ref></char></note>pa t gen lakrent SENYÈ a. Pou sa, SENYÈ a te voye lyon pami yo ki te touye kèk nan yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26"/>Akoz sa, yo te pale avèk wa Assyrie. Yo te di li: “Nasyon sa yo ke ou te pote ale an egzil nan lavil Samarie yo pa konnen koutim a dye nan peyi a. Pou sa, li te voye lyon pami yo, e tande byen, yo touye yo akoz yo pa konnen koutim a dye nan peyi a.”<verse eid="2KI 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27"/>Alò, wa Assyrie a te fè kòmand e te di: “Mennen la youn nan prèt ke ou te pote an egzil yo e kite li ale viv la. Epi kite li enstwi yo koutim a dye peyi a.”<verse eid="2KI 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28"/>Konsa, youn nan prèt ke yo te pote ale an egzil soti Samarie yo te vin viv Béthel, e li te enstwi yo jan yo te dwe gen lakrent SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2KI 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29"/>Men chak nasyon te toujou fè dye pa li e te mete yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31">I Wa 12:31</ref></char></note>lakay yo sou wo plas ke pèp Samarie a te konn fè yo, chak nasyon nan vil pa yo kote yo te viv la. <verse eid="2KI 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:24">II Wa 17:24</ref></char></note>Moun Babylone yo te fè Succoth-Benoth, moun Cuth yo te fè Nergal e moun Hamath yo te fè Aschima. <verse eid="2KI 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31"/>Moun Avva yo te fè Nibchaz avèk Tharthak; sila nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:17">II Wa 17:17</ref></char></note>Sepharvaïm yo te brile pitit pa yo nan dife pou onore <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:37">II Wa 19:37</ref></char></note>Adrammélec avèk Anamélec, dye a Sepharvaïm yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32"/>Yo te gen lakrent osi a SENYÈ a, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31">I Wa 12:31</ref></char></note>chwazi pami yo menm prèt a wo plas yo, ki te aji pou yo nan kay wo plas yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33"/>Yo te krent SENYÈ a e osi, yo te sèvi dye pa yo selon koutim a nasyon pami sila yo te pote ale an egzil yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34"/>Jis rive jou sa a, yo fè selon ansyen koutim yo: yo pa krent SENYÈ a, ni yo pa swiv règleman pa Li yo ni òdonans, ni lalwa a, ni kòmandman ke SENYÈ a te kòmande fis a Jacob yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Jen 32:28</ref></char></note>ke li te bay non Israël yo; <verse eid="2KI 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35"/>avèk sila SENYÈ a te fè yon akò. Li te kòmande yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:10">Jij 6:10</ref></char></note>“Nou p ap gen krent lòt dye yo, ni bese nou menm ba devan yo, ni sèvi yo ni fè sakrifis a yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36"/>Men SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:15-30">Egz 14:15-30</ref></char></note>ki te mennen nou monte soti nan peyi Égypte la avèk gran pouvwa e avèk yon bra lonje, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:32">Lev 19:32</ref></char></note>Li menm nou va gen krent. A Li menm, nou va bese ba e a Li menm, nou va fè sakrifis. <verse eid="2KI 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37"/>Règleman avèk òdonans avèk lalwa ak kòmandman ke Li te ekri pou nou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Det 5:32</ref></char></note>nou va obsève pou fè yo jis pou tout tan. Nou p ap fè lakrent lòt dye yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38"/>Akò ke m te fè avèk nou an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:23">Det 4:23</ref></char></note>nou p ap bliye li, ni nou p ap gen lakrent lòt dye yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39"/>Men SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, nou va krent Li. Epi Li va delivre nou soti nan men a tout lènmi pa nou yo.”<verse eid="2KI 17:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40"/>Sepandan, yo pa t tande; men yo te fè selon abitid pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 17:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:5">So 1:5</ref></char></note>Pou sa, malgre nasyon sila yo te gen lakrent SENYÈ a, yo osi te sèvi zidòl pa yo. Pitit pa yo tou ak pitit pitit pa yo, jis jan ke zansèt pa yo te konn fè; konsa, yo fè jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="2KI 17:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan twazyèm ane Osée, fis a Éla a, wa Israël la ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:27">II Kwo 28:27</ref></char></note>Ézéchias, fis Achaz la, wa Juda a, te devni wa a. <verse eid="2KI 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2"/>Li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:1-2">II Kwo 29:1-2</ref></char></note>venn-senkan lè l te devni wa e li te renye pandan vent-nèf ane Jérusalem. Non manman li se te Abi, fi a Zacharie a. <verse eid="2KI 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:3">II Wa 20:3</ref></char></note>Li te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a, selon tout sa ke zansèt li yo, David te konn fè. <verse eid="2KI 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:22">II Wa 18:22</ref></char></note>Li te retire wo plas yo, li te kraze pilye sakre yo, e li te koupe desann Astarté la. Anplis, li te kraze an mòso <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-29">Nonb 21:21-29</ref></char></note>sèpan an bwonz ke Moïse te fè a, paske jis rive nan jou sa yo, fis Israël yo te konn brile lansan pou li; epi li te rele Nehuschtan. <verse eid="2KI 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:10">II Wa 19:10</ref></char></note>Li te mete konfyans li nan SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:25">II Wa 23:25</ref></char></note>jiskaske, apre li, pa t gen tankou li nan tout wa Juda yo, ni nan sila ki te avan l yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6"/>Paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:20">Det 10:20</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm a SENYÈ a. Li pa t varye nan swiv Li, men li te kenbe kòmandman ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7"/>Epi SENYÈ a te avèk li. Nenpòt kote li te ale, li te reyisi. Li te fè rebèl kont wa a Assyrie a e li pa t sèvi li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:7">II Wa 16:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:18">II Kwo 28:18</ref></char></note>Li te venk Filisten yo soti rive nan Gaza avèk teritwa li, soti nan tou kay gad yo, jis rive nan gwo vil fòtifye a.<verse eid="2KI 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9"/>Alò, nan katriyèm ane Wa Ézéchias la, ki te setyèm ane Osée, fis a Éla a, wa Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:3-7">II Wa 17:3-7</ref></char></note>Salmanasar, wa Assyrie a, te monte kont Samarie, e te fè syèj kont li. <verse eid="2KI 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10"/>Nan fen twazan, yo te kaptire li, epi nan sizyèm ane Ézéchias la, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">II Wa 17:6</ref></char></note>nan nevyèm ane Osée a, wa Israël la, Samarie te vin kaptire. <verse eid="2KI 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11"/>Konsa, wa Assyrie a te pote Israël ale an egzil nan Assyrie, e li te mete yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:26">I Kwo 5:26</ref></char></note>Chalach sou rivyè Gozan nan vil a Mèdes yo, <verse eid="2KI 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12"/>paske yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:6">I Wa 9:6</ref></char></note>pa t obeyi vwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, men yo te transgrese akò pa Li a, menm tout sa ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te kòmande yo. Yo pa t koute yo, ni fè yo.<verse eid="2KI 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:1">II Kwo 32:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan katòzyèm ane a Wa Ézéchias, Sanchérib la, wa Assyrie a te vin monte kont tout vil fòtifye Juda yo, e li te sezi yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14"/>Alò, Ézéchias, wa Juda a te voye kote wa Assyrie a nan Lakis. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:7">II Wa 18:7</ref></char></note>“Mwen te fè mal. Rale bak sòti sou mwen; nenpòt sa ke ou mande m peye, m ap sipòte l.” Pou sa, wa Assyrie a te fè demand a Ézéchias pou peye twa san talan ajan avèk trant talan lò. <verse eid="2KI 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:18-19">I Wa 15:18-19</ref></char></note>Ézéchias te bay tout ajan ki te twouve nan kay SENYÈ a ak nan kès lakay wa a. <verse eid="2KI 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16"/>Nan tan sa a, Ézéchias te koupe retire lò nan pòt tanp SENYÈ a, avèk chanbrann pòt ke Ézéchias, wa Juda a, te kouvri a e li te bay li a wa Assyrie a.<verse eid="2KI 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17"/>Epi wa Assyrie a te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:2">II Wa 19:2</ref></char></note>Tharthan, Rab-Saris avèk Rabschaké sòti nan Lakis avèk yon gwo lame rive kote Ézéchias Jérusalem. Konsa, yo te monte pou te rive Jérusalem. Epi lè yo te monte, yo te rive e te kanpe kote kanal souteren an, nan ma sous dlo piwo a, ki te sou chemen chan lesiv la. <verse eid="2KI 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18"/>Lè yo te rele wa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:2">II Wa 19:2</ref></char></note>Élikiam, fis a Hilkija a, ki te sou tout kay la ak Schebna, grefye a ak Joach, fis a Asaph la, achivist la, te parèt kote yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19"/>Epi Rabschaké te di yo: “Pale koulye a a Ézéchias: ‘Konsa pale gran wa a, wa Assyrie a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:10">II Kwo 32:10</ref></char></note>“Ki kalite konfyans sa ke ou genyen an? <verse eid="2KI 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20"/>Ou di nou (malgre se pawòl vid yo ye): ‘Mwen gen konsèy avèk pwisans pou fè lagè.’ Alò, sou kilès ou depann, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:7">II Wa 18:7</ref></char></note>pou ou vin fè rebèl kont mwen an? <verse eid="2KI 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21"/>Alò, veye byen, ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:2-7">És 30:2-7</ref></char></note>depann de baton a wozo kraze sa a, sou Égypte menm. Sou sila si yon nonm apiye, l ap fonse antre nan men l e pèse l nèt. Se konsa, Farawon va ye pou tout sila ki depann de li yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22"/>Men si ou di mwen: ‘Nou mete konfyans nan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an’, se pa li menm pou sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">II Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>Ézéchias te retire wo plas avèk lotèl yo, e ki te di a Juda avèk Jérusalem: ‘Nou va adore devan lotèl sa a Jérusalem?’ <verse eid="2KI 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23"/>Pou sa, vini, fè yon antant avèk mèt mwen, wa a Assyrie a, e mwen va ba ou de mil cheval, si ou kab menm mete moun sou do yo. <verse eid="2KI 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24"/>Kijan ou kab reziste a menm youn nan pi piti a sèvitè mèt mwen yo e depann de Égypte pou cha ak chevalye? <verse eid="2KI 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25"/>Èske se san soutyen SENYÈ a ke m vin monte kont plas sa a pou detwi li? SENYÈ a te di m ‘Monte kont plas sa a pou detwi l.’”’”<verse eid="2KI 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26"/>Alò Éliakim, fis a Hilkija a, avèk Schebna ak Joach te di a Rabschaké: “Pale koulye a a sèvitè ou yo an Arameyen, paske nou konprann li. Pa pale avèk nou an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:7">Esd 4:7</ref></char></note>Jideyen nan zòrèy a moun ki sou mi yo.”<verse eid="2KI 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27"/>Men Rabschaké te di yo: “Èske mèt mwen an te voye m sèlman a mèt pa w la pou pale pawòl sila yo, pa pou mesye ki chita sou mi yo, ki va manje pwòp watè pa yo e bwè dlo pipi pa yo ansanm avè w?”<verse eid="2KI 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28"/>Epi Rabschaké te kanpe, li te kriye avèk yon vwa fò an Jideyen. Li te di: “Tande pawòl gran wa a, wa Assyrie a! <verse eid="2KI 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29"/>Konsa pale wa a! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:15">II Kwo 32:15</ref></char></note>‘Pa kite Ézéchias twonpe nou, paske li p ap kab delivre nou pou sòti nan men m. <verse eid="2KI 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30"/>Ni pa kite Ézéchias mennen nou pou mete konfyans nan SENYÈ a, pou l di: “SENYÈ a va anverite delivre nou, e vil sa a p ap livre nan men a gran wa a Assyrie a.” <verse eid="2KI 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31"/>Pa koute Ézéchias.’ Paske konsa pale wa Assyrie a: ‘Fè lapè nou avèk mwen e sòti vin kote mwen. Manje nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:20-25">I Wa 4:20-25</ref></char></note>chak nan pwòp chan rezen pa nou, nou chak pye fig mi etranje pa nou e nou chak nan pwòp dlo sitèn pa nou, <verse eid="2KI 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32"/>jiskaske mwen rive pou pran nou ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:7-9">Det 8:7-9</ref></char></note>yon lòt peyi, yon peyi ak sereyal avèk diven nèf, yon peyi avèk bwa doliv ak siwo myèl, pou nou kapab viv e pa mouri.’ Men pa koute Ézéchias lè li mal dirije nou pou di: ‘SENYÈ a va delivre nou.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:12">II Wa 19:12</ref></char></note>Èske okenn nan dye a peyi sila yo te delivre peyi pa yo a devan men wa a Assyrie a? <verse eid="2KI 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:13">II Wa 19:13</ref></char></note> Kote dye a Hamath yo oswa Arpad yo? Kote dye a Sepharvaïm yo, oswa Héna avèk Ivva yo? Èske yo te delivre Samarie pou l sòti nan men m? <verse eid="2KI 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35"/>Kilès pami tout dye a peyi yo ki te delivre peyi pa yo devan men m, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-3">Sòm 2:1-3</ref> </char></note>pou SENYÈ a ta dwe delivre Jérusalem soti nan men m?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36"/>Men pèp la te rete an silans e pa t reponn menm yon mo; paske lòd a wa a se te “Pa reponn li”. <verse eid="2KI 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37"/>Epi Éliakim, fis a Hilkija a, ki te sou tout kay la, Schebna, grefye a ak Joach, fis a Asaph la, achivist la, te vin kote Ézéchias <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:30">II Wa 6:30</ref> </char></note>avèk rad yo tou chire pou te pale li pawòl a Rabschaké yo.<verse eid="2KI 18:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:1">És 37:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè Ézéchias te tande sa, li te chire rad li. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:27">I Wa 21:27</ref></char></note>te kouvri kò li avèk twal sak e li te antre lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2"/>Epi li te voye Éliakim ki te sou tout kay avèk Schebna, grefye a ak ansyen pami prèt yo, kouvri avèk twal sak kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:1">És 1:1</ref></char></note>Ésaïe, pwofèt la, fis a Amots la. <verse eid="2KI 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3"/>Yo te di li: “Konsa pale Ézéchias: ‘Jou sa a se yon jou gwo twoub, chatiman, ak abandon; pwiske pitit yo vin parèt pou akouche, men pa gen fòs pou fè l. <verse eid="2KI 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4"/>Petèt SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, va tande tout pawòl a Rabschaké yo ke mèt li a, wa Assyrie a, te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:35">II Wa 18:35</ref></char></note>pou repwoche Bondye Vivan an e va repwoche pawòl ke SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, te tande a. Pou sa, ofri lapriyè pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">És 1:9</ref></char></note>retay ki toujou rete a.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5"/>Pou sa, sèvitè a wa Ézéchias yo te vin kote Ésaïe. <verse eid="2KI 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6"/>Ésaïe te di yo: “Konsa nou va pale a mèt nou an: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Pa krent akoz pawòl ke ou te tande yo, avèk sila sèvitè a wa Assyrie yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:22-35">II Wa 18:22-35</ref></char></note>te blasfeme Mwen yo. <verse eid="2KI 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7"/>Veye byen, mwen va mete yon lespri nan li pou l tande yon fo nouvèl pou retounen nan pwòp peyi pa li. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:37">II Wa 19:37</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè l tonbe pa nepe nan pwòp peyi li.”’”<verse eid="2KI 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8"/>Alò, Rabschaké te retounen e te twouve wa Assyrie a t ap goumen kont Libna; paske li te tande ke li te fin kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:14">II Wa 18:14</ref></char></note>Lakis. <verse eid="2KI 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9"/>Lè l te tande sa pa Tirhaka, wa Ethiopie a, vwala, li vin parèt pou goumen kont ou, li te ankò voye mesaje yo kote Ézéchias e te di: <verse eid="2KI 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10"/>“Konsa ou va pale a Ézéchias, wa Juda a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:33">II Wa 18:33</ref></char></note>‘Pa kite Bondye ou a nan Sila ou mete konfyans ou an twonpe ou e di: “Jérusalem p ap antre nan men a wa Assyrie a.” <verse eid="2KI 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11"/>Gade byen, ou konn tande sa ke wa Assyrie a te fè a tout peyi yo, destriksyon konplèt. Èske se konsa ke ou va delivre a? <verse eid="2KI 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12"/>Èske dye a nasyon sila yo ke zansèt mwen yo te detwi yo, te delivre yo, menm? Gozan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref></char></note>Charan, Retseph, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:12">És 37:12</ref></char></note>fis a Éden ki te Telassar yo? <verse eid="2KI 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:34">II Wa 18:34</ref></char></note>Kibò wa Hamath la ye, wa Arpad la, wa gran vil Sepharvaïm nan, Henna, avèk Ivva?’”<verse eid="2KI 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:14">És 37:14</ref></char></note>Ézéchias te pran lèt la soti nan men a mesaje yo e li te li li. Li te monte lakay SENYÈ a, e li te louvri li devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15"/>Ézéchias te priye devan SENYÈ a, e te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, ki chita sou twòn li pami cheriben yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:15">II Wa 5:15</ref></char></note>Ou se Bondye a, Ou sèl Ou pami tout wayòm sou latè yo. Ou te fè syèl la avèk tè a. <verse eid="2KI 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16"/>Panche zòrèy Ou, O SENYÈ a pou tande. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:40">II Kwo 6:40</ref></char></note>Ouvri zye Ou O SENYÈ pou wè. Koute pawòl a Sanchérib yo, ke li te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:4">II Wa 19:4</ref></char></note> pou repwoche Bondye Vivan an. <verse eid="2KI 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17"/>Anverite, O SENYÈ, wa Assyrie yo te devaste nasyon yo avèk peyi pa yo, <verse eid="2KI 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18"/>epi yo te jete dye pa yo nan dife, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:9-20">És 44:9-20</ref></char></note>paske se pa dye yo ye, men se zèv a men lèzòm yo, bwa avèk wòch. Pou sa, yo te detwi yo. <verse eid="2KI 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19"/>Alò, O SENYÈ, Bondye nou an, mwen priye Ou, delivre nou nan men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:42-43">I Wa 8:42-43</ref></char></note>pou tout wayòm sou latè yo kab konnen Ou sèl, O SENYÈ, se Bondye a.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20"/>Epi Ésaïe, fis a Amots la te voye kote Ézéchias e te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Akoz ou te priye a Mwen pou Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:5">II Wa 20:5</ref></char></note>Mwen te tande.”<verse eid="2KI 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21"/>Sa se pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale kont li an:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">“Li te meprize ou e moke ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:17">Jr 14:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fi vyèj a Sion an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:25">Sòm 109:25</ref></char></note>souke tèt li dèyè do ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Fi a Jérusalem nan!<verse eid="2KI 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22"/>Se kilès ou te repwoche e blasfeme a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Epi kont kilès ou te leve vwa ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">avèk ògèy, ou te leve zye ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:24">És 5:24</ref></char></note>Sila ki Sen a Israël la?<verse eid="2KI 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:17">II Wa 18:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa mesaje ou yo, ou te repwoche SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Ou te di: “Avèk anpil cha mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">mwen te rive sou wotè a mòn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Jis rive nan kote pi izole nan Liban an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">mwen va koupe gwo bwa sèd li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">avèk bwa pichpen pi chwazi li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Epi mwen va antre jis nan lojman pi izole yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">nan pi gran rakbwa ki te genyen yo.<verse eid="2KI 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24"/>Mwen te fouye pwi yo e te bwè dlo etranje li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Epi avèk pla pye mwen, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:6">És 19:6</ref></char></note>seche</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">tout rivyè Égypte yo.”<verse eid="2KI 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:7">És 45:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske ou pa t tande?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Depi lontan Mwen te fè l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Depi nan tan ansyen yo, Mwen te planifye l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5">És 10:5</ref> </char>
    </note>Koulye a, Mwen gen tan fè l vin rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">ke ou ta fè vil fòtifye yo vin pil ranblè.<verse eid="2KI 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26"/>Pou sa, abitan pa yo te manke fòs.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Yo te deranje e te vin wont nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Yo te tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 129:6">Sòm 129:6</ref></char></note>zèb chan, tankou zèb vèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">tankou zèb sou twati kay ki vin brile avan li kab grandi.<verse eid="2KI 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27"/>Men M konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1">Sòm 139:1</ref></char></note>chita ou, sòti avèk antre pa ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:27">ak laraj ke ou konn fè kont Mwen.<verse eid="2KI 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28"/>Epi akoz laraj ou kont Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">akoz awogans ou vin monte nan zòrèy Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">pou sa, mwen va mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:9">Éz 19:9</ref></char></note>zen Mwen nan nen ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">ak brid Mwen, pou antre nan lèv ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">epi Mwen va vire ou fè ou fè bak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">pa menm chemen ke ou te antre a.”<verse eid="2KI 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29"/>“Epi sa va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Egz 3:12</ref></char></note>sign lan pou ou: Ou va manje nan lane sila a sa ki grandi pou kont li, nan dezyèm ane a, sa ki sòti menm jan an konsa e nan twazyèm ane a, ou va simen, rekòlte, plante chan rezen yo e manje fwi pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:4">II Wa 19:4</ref></char></note>Retay ki chape lakay Juda a va ankò pran rasin k ap pouse pa anba pou bay fwi pa anlè. <verse eid="2KI 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31"/>Paske depi Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:20">És 10:20</ref></char></note>va vin sòti yon retay e sòti nan Mòn Sion, sila ki chape yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">És 9:7</ref></char></note>Zèl SENYÈ a va acheve sa.”<verse eid="2KI 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32"/>“Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a selon wa Assyrie a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:7-10">És 8:7-10</ref></char></note>‘Li p ap rive nan vil sila a, ni tire yon flèch la. Li p ap rive devan li avèk yon boukliye, ni monte yon ran syèj kont li. <verse eid="2KI 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:28">II Wa 19:28</ref></char></note>Pa menm chemen ke li te antre a, pa li menm, li va retounen e li p ap rive nan vil sila a’, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:6">II Wa 20:6</ref></char></note>‘Paske Mwen va defann vil sa a pou sove li pou koz Mwen menm ak pou koz sèvitè mwen an, David.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 24:16">II Sam 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi li te vin rive menm nwit sa a ke zanj SENYÈ a te sòti e te frape san-katre-ven-senk-mil moun nan kan Asiryen yo. Lè moun yo te leve granmmaten, men vwala, yo tout te mouri. <verse eid="2KI 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:7">II Wa 19:7</ref></char></note>Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a, te sòti e te retounen lakay li pou te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:2">Jon 1:2</ref></char></note>Ninive. <verse eid="2KI 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37"/>Konsa, li te vin rive pandan li t ap adore lakay Nisroc la, dye pa li a, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:17-31">II Wa 19:17-31</ref></char></note>Adrammélec avèk Scharetser te touye li avèk nepe, epi yo te chape nan peyi Ararat. Epi Ésar-Haddon, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 19:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:24">II Kwo 32:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan jou sa yo, Ézéchias te vin malad jis rive nan pòt lanmò. Epi Ésaïe, pwofèt la, fis a Amots la, te vin kote li e te di li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, ‘Mete lakay ou an lòd; paske ou va mouri e ou p ap viv.’”<verse eid="2KI 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2"/>Konsa, Ézéchias te vire figi li vè miray la pou te priye a SENYÈ a. Li te di: <verse eid="2KI 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3"/>“Sonje koulye a, O SENYÈ a, mwen sipliye Ou,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:3-6">II Wa 18:3-6</ref></char></note> jan mwen te mache devan Ou anverite avèk tout kè m nan, ak jan mwen te fè sa ki bon nan zye Ou a.” Epi Ézéchias te kriye byen anmè.<verse eid="2KI 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4"/>Avan Ésaïe te sòti nan mitan vil a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote li. Li te di: <verse eid="2KI 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5"/>“Retounen pale ak Ézéchias, dirijan pèp mwen an: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt ou a, David: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:20">II Wa 19:20</ref></char></note>“Mwen te tande lapriyè pa w la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:12">Sòm 39:12</ref></char></note>Mwen te wè dlo ki sòti nan zye ou a. Men vwala, Mwen va geri ou. Nan twazyèm jou a, ou va monte lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6"/>Mwen va mete kenzan sou lavi ou e mwen va delivre ou avèk vil sa a soti nan men a wa Assyrie. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:24">II Wa 19:24</ref></char></note>Mwen va defann vil sa a pou koz pa Mwen ak pou koz David, sèvitè Mwen an.”’”<verse eid="2KI 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7"/>Konsa, Ésaïe te di: “Pran yon gato figye etranje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:7">Yo te pran l e te mete li sou apse a, e li te vin refè.<verse eid="2KI 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8"/>Alò, Ézéchias te di a Ésaïe: “Ki sign ki va parèt ke SENYÈ a va geri mwen, e ke mwen va monte lakay SENYÈ a nan twazyèm jou a?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9"/>Ésaïe te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 38:7">És 38:7</ref></char></note>“Sa va sign a ou menm soti nan SENYÈ a, ke SENYÈ a va fè bagay ke li te pale a: èske ou pito lonbraj la avanse dis pa, oswa fè bak dis pa?”<verse eid="2KI 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10"/>Alò, Ézéchias te reponn: “Li tèlman fasil pou lonbraj la avanse dis pa. Men non, kite li fè bak dis pa.”<verse eid="2KI 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11"/>Ésaïe, pwofèt la, te kriye a SENYÈ a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:12-14">Jos 10:12-14</ref></char></note>Li te fè lonbraj la fè bak dis pa sou eskalye a sou sila li te avanse nan eskalye Achaz la.<verse eid="2KI 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:31">II Kwo 32:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan tan sa a, Berodac-Baladan, fis a Baladan nan, wa Babylone nan, te voye lèt avèk yon kado bay Ézéchias, paske li te tande ke Ézéchias te konn malad. <verse eid="2KI 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13"/>Ézéchias te koute yo e montre yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:27">II Kwo 32:27</ref></char></note>tout kay trezò li a, ajan avèk lò, epis avèk lwil presye, lakay boukliye li yo avèk tout sa ki te konn twouve nan trezò li yo. Pa t gen anyen lakay li ni nan tout wayòm li a ke li pa t montre yo.<verse eid="2KI 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14"/>Alò, pwofèt la, Ésaïe, te vin kote Ézéchias. Li te mande li: “Kisa mesye sila yo te di e depi kibò yo sòti pou rive kote ou a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">Epi Ézéchias te di: “Yo sòti nan yon peyi lwen, nan Babylone.”<verse eid="2KI 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15"/>Li te di: “Kisa yo te wè lakay ou a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Ézéchias te reponn: “Yo te wè tout sa ki lakay mwen an. Nanpwen anyen pami trezò mwen yo ke m pa t montre yo.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16"/>Konsa, Ésaïe te di a Ézéchias: “Tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17"/>‘Veye byen, jou yo ap vini lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:10">II Kwo 36:10</ref></char></note>tout sa ki lakay ou avèk tout sa ke zansèt ou yo te mete an depo jis rive jou sa a va pote ale Babylone. Anyen p ap rete, pale SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18"/>Kèk nan fis ou yo ki va sòti nan ou menm, ke ou va fè, va retire ale; epi yo va devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:3-7">Dan 1:3-7</ref></char></note>ofisye nan palè a wa Babylone nan.’”<verse eid="2KI 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19"/>Alò Ézéchias te di a Ésaïe: “Pawòl SENYÈ a ke ou te bay la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">I Sam 3:18</ref></char></note>bon.” Paske li te reflechi: “Èske se pa sa, si k ap gen lapè avèk verite nan jou mwen yo?”<verse eid="2KI 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:32">II Kwo 32:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Alò, tout lòt zèv a Ézéchias yo avèk tout pwisans li ak jan li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:16">Né 3:16</ref></char></note>fè sous dlo a avèk kanal ki te mennen dlo a nan vil la, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:33">II Kwo 32:33</ref></char></note>Konsa, Ézéchias te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e Manassé, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 20:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 33:1-9">II Kwo 33:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Manassé te gen laj douzan lè l te devni wa a e li te renye senkann-senk ane Jérusalem. Manman li te rele Hephtsiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">II Wa 16:3</ref></char></note>selon tout abominasyon a nasyon ke SENYÈ a te rache devan fis Israël yo. <verse eid="2KI 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">II Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>li te rebati wo plas ke Ézéchias te detwi yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31-33">I Wa 16:31-33</ref></char></note>li te monte lotèl pou Baal yo, e li te fè yon Astarté, jan Achab, wa Israël la te fè pou te adore tout lame syèl la e te sèvi yo. <verse eid="2KI 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:10-16">II Wa 16:10-16</ref> </char></note>Li te bati lotèl lakay SENYÈ a, sou sila SENYÈ a te di: “Nan Jérusalem, Mwen va mete non Mwen.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5"/>Li te bati lotèl pou tout lame syèl la nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:12">I Wa 7:12</ref></char></note>de lakou lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">II Wa 16:3</ref></char></note>Li te fè fis li yo pase nan dife, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26-31">Lev 19:26-31</ref> </char></note> pratike maji e sèvi divinasyon. Li te sèvi moun ki pale ak mò ansanm ak lespri. Li te fè anpil mal nan zye SENYÈ a ki te pwovoke Li a lakòlè. <verse eid="2KI 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:21">Det 16:21</ref></char></note>li te plase imaj a Astarté ke li te fè a, nan kay ke SENYÈ a te di a David avèk fis li a, Salomon: “Nan kay sila a ak Jérusalem nan, ke Mwen te chwazi soti nan tout tribi Israël yo, Mwen va mete non Mwen jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="2KI 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8"/>Epi mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:10">II Sam 7:10</ref></char></note>p ap fè pye Israël mache egare ankò deyò peyi ke m te bay a zansèt yo a, si sèlman, yo va obsève pou fè selon tout sa ke M te kòmande yo, selon tout lalwa ke sèvitè Mwen an, Moïse te kòmande yo.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9"/>Men yo pa t koute e Manassé te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 29:12">Pwov 29:12</ref></char></note>sedwi yo pou fè mal plis ke nasyon ke SENYÈ a te detwi devan fis Israël yo.<verse eid="2KI 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale pa sèvitè yo, pwofèt yo, e te di: <verse eid="2KI 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11"/>“Akoz Manassé, wa Juda a, te fè abominasyon sila yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:16">Jen 15:16</ref></char></note>fè plis mechanste pase tout Amoreyen ki te avan li yo, e anplis, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:16">II Wa 21:16</ref></char></note>fè Juda peche avèk zidòl pa li yo; <verse eid="2KI 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12"/>pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la: ‘Gade byen, Mwen ap mennen yon tèlman gwo twoub sou Jérusalem avèk Juda, pou nenpòt moun ki tande koz li, toude zòrèy li va sonnen avèk sezisman. <verse eid="2KI 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:11">És 34:11</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lonje sou Jérusalem lizyè Samarie a, avèk fil aplon kay Achab la, e Mwen va siye Jérusalem jan yon moun ta siye yon plato. Konsa m ap siye li e vire li tèt anba. <verse eid="2KI 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14"/>Mwen va abandone retay eritaj Mwen an e Mwen va livre yo nan men a lènmi yo. Yo va vin piyaje e depouye pa tout lènmi yo, <verse eid="2KI 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15"/>akoz yo te fè mal devan zye Mwen e te pwovoke Mwen a lakòlè soti jou ke zansèt pa yo te sòti an Égypte la, menm rive jodi a.’”<verse eid="2KI 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:4">II Wa 24:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anplis, Manassé te vèse san inosan jiskaske li te ranpli Jérusalem soti nan yon bout jis rive nan yon lòt. Li te fè sa, anplis, peche pa li avèk sila li te fè Juda peche nan fè mal devan zye SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2KI 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 33:11-19">II Kwo 33:11-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Manassé yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè ak peche ke li te komèt yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:20">II Kwo 33:20</ref></char></note>Konsa, Manassé te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo e te antere nan jaden lakay li, nan jaden Uzza a. Epi Amon, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 33:21-23">II Kwo 33:21-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amon te gen venn-dezan lè l te devni wa e li te renye dezan Jérusalem. Manman li te rele Meschullémeth, fi a Haruts la, nan Jotba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20"/>Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:2-16">II Wa 21:2-16</ref></char></note>jan Manassé, papa li te konn fè a. <verse eid="2KI 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21"/>Paske li te mache nan tout chemen ke papa li te konn mache yo, e li te sèvi zidòl ke papa li te konn sèvi, e te adore yo. <verse eid="2KI 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:17">II Wa 22:17</ref></char></note>li te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt li yo, e li pa t mache nan chemen SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:20">II Wa 12:20</ref></char></note>Sèvitè a Amon yo te fè konplo kont li e yo te touye wa a nan pwòp kay li. <verse eid="2KI 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:5">II Wa 14:5</ref></char></note>pèp peyi a te touye tout sila ki te fè konplo kont Wa Amon yo, e pèp peyi a te fè Josias, fis li a, wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2KI 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv ke Amon te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26"/>Li te antere nan tonm pa li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:18">II Wa 21:18</ref></char></note>nan jaden Uzza a e Josias, fis li a, te devni Wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 21:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 34:1">II Kwo 34:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Josias te gen laj uitan lè l te vin wa a e li te renye tranteyen ane Jérusalem. Non manman li te Jedida, fi Adaja a nan Botskath. <verse eid="2KI 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Det 5:32</ref></char></note>fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a e li te mache nan tout chemen a zansèt papa li a, David, ni li pa t vire akote ni adwat, ni agoch.<verse eid="2KI 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:8">II Kwo 34:8</ref></char></note>nan di-zuityèm ane Wa Josias la, wa a te voye Schaphan, fis a Atsalia a, fis a Meschullam nan, skrib la, lakay SENYÈ a. Li te di: <verse eid="2KI 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:4-10">II Wa 12:4-10</ref></char></note>“Monte kote Hilkija, wo prèt la, pou li kapab kontwole lajan ki antre lakay SENYÈ a, lajan ke gadyen pòtay yo te ranmase soti nan pèp la. <verse eid="2KI 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:11-14">II Wa 12:11-14</ref></char></note>Kite yo livre li nan men a ouvriye k ap dirije lakay SENYÈ a e kite yo bay li a ouvriye ki lakay SENYÈ a pou repare donmaj nan kay la; <verse eid="2KI 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6"/>pou chapant yo, konstriktè yo avèk mason yo e pou achte gwo bwa avèk wòch taye pou fè reparasyon kay la. <verse eid="2KI 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7"/>Sèlman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:15">II Wa 12:15</ref></char></note>nou p ap fè kontabilite pou lajan ki livre nan men yo, paske yo aji an bòn fwa.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8"/>Alò, Hilkija, wo prèt la, te di a Schaphan, skrib la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:24-26">Det 31:24-26</ref></char></note>“Mwen te twouve liv lalwa a lakay SENYÈ a.” Konsa, Hilkija te bay liv la a Schaphan ki te li li. <verse eid="2KI 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9"/>Schaphan, skrib la, te rive kote wa a. Li te pote pawòl la kote wa a, e li te di: “Sèvitè ou yo te vide lajan ki te twouve nan kay la e yo te livre li nan men a ouvriye k ap dirije lakay SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10"/>Anplis, Schaphan, skrib la, te pale wa a e te di: “Hilkija, prèt la, te ban mwen yon liv.” Epi Schaphan te li li nan prezans a wa a.<verse eid="2KI 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11"/>Lè wa a te tande pawòl a liv lalwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>li te chire rad li. <verse eid="2KI 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12"/>Epi wa a te kòmande Hilkija, prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:22">II Wa 25:22</ref></char></note>Achikam fis a Schaphanb la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:20">II Kwo 34:20</ref></char></note>Acbor, fis a Michée a, a Schaphan, skrib la e a Asaja, sèvitè wa a: <verse eid="2KI 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13"/>“Ale mande a SENYÈ a pou mwen avèk pèp la ak tout Juda selon pawòl a liv sa a ki te twouve a. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23-28">Det 29:23-28</ref></char></note>gran se kòlè SENYÈ a ki brile kont nou, akoz zansèt papa nou yo pa t koute pawòl a liv sa a, pou fè selon tout sa ki ekri konsènan nou.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14"/>Pou sa, Hilkija, prèt la, Achikam, Acbor, Schaphan e Asaja te ale kote Hulda, pwofetès la, madanm a Schallum nan, fis a Thikva a, fis a Harhas la, ki te an chaj vètman yo. (Alò, li te rete Jérusalem nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:10">So 1:10</ref></char></note>Katye Second lan). Yo te pale avèk li. <verse eid="2KI 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15"/>Li te di yo: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Pale nonm ki te voye ou kote mwen an, <verse eid="2KI 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:27">Det 29:27</ref></char></note>pote malè sou plas sa a ak sou sila ki rete ladann yo, menm tout pawòl a liv sa a ke wa Juda te di yo. <verse eid="2KI 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:25-26">Det 29:25-26</ref></char></note>Akoz yo te abandone Mwen e te brile lansan a lòt dye yo pou yo ta kab pwovoke Mwen a lakòlè avèk tout zèv men pa yo; pou sa, gran lakòlè Mwen va brile kont plas sa a, e li p ap etenn.”’ <verse eid="2KI 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18"/>Men pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:26">II Kwo 34:26</ref></char></note>wa Juda a, ki te voye ou pou mande a SENYÈ a, konsa ou va pale ak li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, ‘selon pawòl ke ou te tande yo: <verse eid="2KI 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:17">Sòm 51:17</ref></char></note>Akoz kè ou te vin mou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:3">Egz 10:3</ref></char></note>ou te imilye ou devan SENYÈ a lè ou te tande sa Mwen te pale kont plas sa a ak kont sila ki rete ladann yo, pou yo ta devni yon dezolasyon ak yon malediksyon, epi akoz ou te chire rad ou e te kriye devan Mwen, anverite, Mwen te tande ou,’ deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20"/>Pou sa, byen gade, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:30">II Wa 23:30</ref></char></note>ranmase ou a zansèt pa ou yo e ou va ranmase rive nan tonm pa ou a anpè. Zye ou p ap wè tout mal ke Mwen va mennen sou plas sa a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Konsa, yo te mennen pote pawòl la bay wa a.<verse eid="2KI 22:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 29:32">II Kwo 29:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò wa a te voye rasanble vè li menm tout ansyen Juda ak Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2"/>Wa a te monte kote kay SENYÈ a ak tout mesye Juda yo, tout moun ki te rete Jérusalem avèk li yo, prèt yo ak pwofèt yo ak tout pèp la, ni gran, ni piti; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:10-13">Det 31:10-13</ref></char></note>li te li nan zòrèy yo, tout pawòl a liv akò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:8">II Wa 22:8</ref></char></note>ki te twouve lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:14-17">II Wa 11:14-17</ref></char></note>Wa a te kanpe akote pilye a pou te fè yon akò devan SENYÈ a, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:4">Det 13:4</ref> </char></note>mache apre SENYÈ a, pou kenbe kòmandman avèk temwayaj li yo avèk règleman li yo avèk tout kè li ak tout nanm li, pou akonpli pawòl akò a ki te ekri nan liv sa a. Epi tout pèp la te antre nan akò a.<verse eid="2KI 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4"/>Konsa, wa a te kòmande Hilkija, wo prèt la e prèt a dezyèm lòd yo avèk gadyen pòtay yo pou mennen fè sòti deyò nan tanp SENYÈ a tout veso ki te fèt pou Baal yo, pou Astarté ak pou tout lame syèl la. Konsa, li te brile yo deyò Jérusalem nan chan Cédron an e li te pote sann yo jis rive Béthel. <verse eid="2KI 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5"/>Li te mete deyò tout prèt zidòl ke wa Juda yo te chwazi pou brile lansan nan wo plas yo nan vil Juda yo ak nan andwa Jérusalem yo. Anplis, sila ki te brile lansan a Baal yo, a solèy la, lalin nan, avèk tout gwoup zetwal yo ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:3">II Wa 21:3</ref></char></note>lame syèl yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6"/>Li te fè mete deyò Astarté la soti lakay SENYÈ a rive Jérusalem nan flèv Cédron an, li te moulen l an poud nèt e li te jete pousyè a nan simityè a pèp la. <verse eid="2KI 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7"/>Osi, li te kraze kay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:24">I Wa 14:24</ref></char></note>mal pwostitiye sakre ki te lakay SENYÈ a, kote fanm t ap trese bagay yo kwoke pou Astarté yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8"/>Epi li te mennen tout prèt yo soti nan tout vil Juda yo, e li te souye wo plas kote prèt yo te konn brile lansan yo, soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:17">Jos 21:17</ref></char></note>Guéba jis rive Beer-Schéba. Li te kraze wo plas pòtay ki te nan antre pòtay Josué a, majistra vil la, ki te bò kote goch pòtay lavil la. <verse eid="2KI 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9"/>Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:10-14">Éz 44:10-14</ref></char></note>prèt wo plas yo pa t monte nan lotèl SENYÈ a Jérusalem, men yo te manje pen san ledven pami frè yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10"/>Anplis, li te souye Topheth, ki nan vale fis Hinnom an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref></char></note>pou pèsòn pa t kab fè fis li oswa fi li pase nan dife <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">I Wa 11:7</ref></char></note>Moloc la. <verse eid="2KI 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11"/>Li te retire cheval ke wa a Juda yo te konn bay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:26">Job 31:26</ref></char></note>solèy la, kote antre kay SENYÈ a, kote chanm Nethan-Mélec la, ofisye a, ki te nan pwovens yo e li te brile cha solèy yo avèk dife. <verse eid="2KI 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12"/>Lotèl ki te sou twati yo, nan wo chanm Achaz ke wa Juda yo te fè a ak lotèl ke Manassé te fè nan de lakou lakay SENYÈ a, wa a te kraze yo. Li te kraze yo e li te jete poud yo nan flèv Cédron an. <verse eid="2KI 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13"/>Wo plas ki te devan Jérusalem yo, ki te adwat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">I Wa 11:7</ref></char></note>mòn pèdisyon ke Salomon te bati pou Astarté la, abominasyon a Sidonyen yo, avèk Kemosch, abominasyon a fis Ammon yo, wa a te souye yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:5-25">Det 7:5-25</ref></char></note>Li te kraze an mòso pilye sakre yo, li te koupe Astarté yo e li te plen plas yo avèk zo moun.<verse eid="2KI 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:1">I Wa 13:1</ref></char></note>lotèl ki te Béthel la avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-33">I Wa 12:28-33</ref></char></note>wo plas ke Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la, ki te fè Israël peche a, menm lotèl sila a avèk wo plas la a li te kraze. Epi li te kraze wòch li yo, li te moulen yo jis yo te fè poud e li te brile Astarté la. <verse eid="2KI 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16"/>Alò, lè Josias te vire gade, li te wè tout simityè ki te sou mòn nan e li te voye pran zo ki te ladann yo, li te brile yo sou lotèl la e te souye li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">I Wa 13:2</ref></char></note>pa pawòl SENYÈ a, ke nonm Bondye a te pwoklame a, sila ki te pwoklame bagay sa yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17"/>Alò, li te di: “Se ki moniman sa a ke m wè la a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Epi mesye lavil yo te di l: “Li se tonm a nonm Bondye ki te sòti Juda a pou te pwoklame bagay sa yo ke ou te fè kont lotèl Béthel la.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18"/>Li te di: “Lese li; pa kite pèsòn deranje zo li.” Konsa, yo te kite zo li yo san deranje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:11-31">I Wa 13:11-31</ref></char></note>avèk zo a pwofèt ki te sòti Samarie a. <verse eid="2KI 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19"/>Anplis, Josias te retire tout kay nan wo plas ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:6-7">II Kwo 34:6-7</ref> </char></note>nan vil Samarie yo, ke wa Israël la te fè pou te pwovoke SENYÈ a, epi li te fè a yo menm sa ke li te fè Béthel la. <verse eid="2KI 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20"/>Tout prèt a wo plas ki te prezan yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:25">II Wa 10:25</ref></char></note>li te touye yo sou lotèl yo, e li te brile zo moun yo sou yo. Konsa, li te retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21"/>Wa a te kòmande tout pèp la. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:1-17">II Kwo 35:1-17</ref></char></note>“Selebre fèt Pak SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:2-8">Det 16:2-8</ref></char></note>jan sa ekri nan liv akò sila a.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:18-19">II Kwo 35:18-19</ref></char></note>Anverite, yon Pak tankou sila a pa t selebre depi nan jou a jij ki te jije Israël yo, ni nan tout jou a wa Israël yo avèk wa Juda yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23"/>Men nan di-zuityèm ane a Wa Josias la, Pak sila a te obsève Jérusalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24"/>Anplis, Josias te retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref></char></note>moun ki te konn rele lespri mò yo, avèk bòkò avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19">Jen 31:19</ref> </char></note>zidòl lakay yo ak tout lòt zidòl avèk tout abominasyon ki te konn wè nan tout peyi Juda a avèk Jérusalem, pou li ta kapab konfime pawòl lalwa ki te ekri nan liv ke Hilkija, prèt la, te twouve lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2KI 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25"/>Avan li, pa t gen wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:5">II Wa 18:5</ref></char></note>tankou li ki te vire vè SENYÈ a avèk tout kè li, avèk tout nanm li e avèk tout fòs li, selon lalwa Moïse la. Ni pa t gen okenn moun tankou li ki te leve apre li. <verse eid="2KI 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26"/>Malgre sa, SENYÈ a pa t kite chalè gran kòlè Li ki te brile kont Juda, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:11-13">II Wa 21:11-13</ref></char></note>akoz tout pwovokasyon avèk sila Manassé te pwovoke Li yo. <verse eid="2KI 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27"/>SENYÈ a te di: “Mwen va retire Juda tou devan zye Mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:11">II Wa 18:11</ref></char></note>jan mwen te retire Israël la. Mwen va voye jete Jérusalem, vil sila ke M te chwazi a ak tanp sou sila Mwen te di: ‘Non Mwen va la a.’”<verse eid="2KI 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Josias yo, avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29"/>Nan jou pa li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:2">Jr 48:2</ref></char></note> Farawon Néco, wa Égypte la, te monte kont wa Assyrie a nan Rivyè Euphrate la e Wa Josias te ale rankontre li. Epi lè Néco te wè l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:20-24">II Kwo 35:20-24</ref></char></note>li te touye li Méguiddo. <verse eid="2KI 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30"/>Sèvitè li yo te kondwi kadav li a nan yon cha soti Méguiddo pou te mennen li rive Jérusalem, e yo te antere li nan pwòp tonm pa li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:1-4">II Kwo 36:1-4</ref></char></note>Konsa, pèp peyi a te pran Joachaz, fis a Josias la, yo te onksyone li, e yo te fè l wa nan plas papa li.<verse eid="2KI 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 3:15">I Kwo 3:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joachaz te gen laj a venn-twazan lè l te devni wa a e li te renye twa mwa Jérusalem. Manman li te rele Hamuthal, fi a Jérémie an nan Libna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:2-7">II Wa 21:2-7</ref></char></note>selon tout sa ke zansèt li yo te fè. <verse eid="2KI 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33"/>Farawon Néco te fèmen li nan prizon nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:6">II Wa 25:6</ref></char></note>Ribla nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:65">I Wa 8:65</ref></char></note>Hamath pou li pa renye Jérusalem, epi li te enpoze sou peyi a yon amann san talan ajan avèk yon talan lò. <verse eid="2KI 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34"/>Farawon Néco te fè Éliakim, fis a Josias la wa nan plas Josias, papa li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:15">I Kwo 3:15</ref></char></note>chanje non li an Jojakim. Men li te mennen Joachaz sòti. Li te mennen li an Égypte e li te mouri la. <verse eid="2KI 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35"/>Konsa, Jojakim te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:33">II Wa 23:33</ref></char></note>bay ajan avèk lò a Farawon, men li te egzije kontribisyon sou peyi a pou l ta kab bay lajan lè Farawon te mande li. Li te egzije ajan avèk lò a soti nan pèp peyi a, chak moun selon kalkil valè pa li, pou vèse bay a Farawon Néco. <verse eid="2KI 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jr 22:18-19</ref></char></note>Jojakim te gen laj venn-senkan lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye onzan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Zébudda, fi a Pedaja a nan Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:32">II Wa 23:32</ref></char></note>selon tout sa ke papa zansèt li yo te konn fè yo.<verse eid="2KI 23:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:1">Jr 25:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan jou pa li yo, Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te monte e Jojakim te vin sèvitè li pandan twazan. Epi, konsa, li te vire fè rebèl kont li. <verse eid="2KI 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2"/>SENYÈ a te voye kont li twoup a Kaldeyen yo, twoup a Siryen yo, twoup Moabit yo ak twoup Amonit yo. Li te voye yo kont Juda pou detwi li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:27">II Wa 23:27</ref></char></note>selon pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale pa sèvitè li yo, pwofèt yo. <verse eid="2KI 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3"/>Anverite, sou kòmand SENYÈ a, li te rive Juda, pou retire yo devan zye Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:26">II Wa 23:26</ref></char></note>akoz peche a Manassé yo selon tout sa ke li te fè yo, <verse eid="2KI 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4"/>anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:16">II Wa 21:16</ref></char></note>ak san inosan li te vèse yo. Paske li te ranpli Jérusalem avèk san inosan e SENYÈ a pa t padone sa. <verse eid="2KI 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jojakim yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik A Wa Juda Yo? <verse eid="2KI 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jr 22:18-19</ref></char></note>Jojakim te dòmi avèk papa zansèt li yo e Jojakin, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2KI 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7"/>Wa Égypte la pa t sòti nan peyi li ankò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2">Jr 46:2</ref></char></note>paske wa Babylone nan te kaptire tout sa ki te pou wa Égypte la soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref> </char></note>flèv Égypte la jis rive nan Rivyè Euphrate la.<verse eid="2KI 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 3:16">I Kwo 3:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jojakin te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:9">II Kwo 36:9</ref></char></note>di-zuit ane lè li te devni wa e li te renye twa mwa Jérusalem. Non manman li se te Néhuschtha, fi a Elnathan an Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9"/>Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:2-7">II Wa 21:2-7</ref></char></note>selon tout sa ke papa li te konn fè yo. <verse eid="2KI 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10"/>Nan tan sa a, sèvitè a wa Babylone yo te monte Jérusalem e vil la te antre anba syèj. <verse eid="2KI 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11"/>Epi Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan te rive nan vil la pandan sèvitè li yo t ap fè syèj li. <verse eid="2KI 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12"/>Jojakin, wa Juda a, te sòti kote wa a Babylone nan, li menm avèk manman li, sèvitè li yo avèk kapitèn li yo ak ofisye li yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:10">II Kwo 36:10</ref></char></note>wa a Babylone nan te pran li an kaptivite nan uityèm ane règn pa li a. <verse eid="2KI 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:17">II Wa 20:17</ref></char></note>Li te pote fè sòti depi la, tout trezò lakay SENYÈ a ak trezò lakay wa a. Li te koupe an mòso tout veso lò ke Salomon, wa Israël la, te fè nan tanp SENYÈ a, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te di a. <verse eid="2KI 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14"/>Konsa, li te mennen an egzil tout Jérusalem avèk tout kapitèn ak tout moun avèk gwo kouraj yo; di-mil kaptif, avèk tout mèt ouvriye ak tout sila ki konn fòme oswa fonn metal yo. <verse eid="2KI 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:24-28">Jr 22:24-28</ref></char></note>li te mennen Jokajin sòti an egzil Babylone, anplis, manman a wa a avèk madanm li yo, ofisye li yo ak tout mesye ki te chèf dirijan peyi yo. Li te mennen yo ale an egzil soti Jérusalem jis rive Babylone. <verse eid="2KI 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16"/>Tout mesye gwo kouraj ak pwisans yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14">II Wa 24:14</ref></char></note>sèt-mil, mèt ouvriye yo, mil, tout te plen avèk fòs e pare pou fè lagè. Tout sila yo, wa Babylone nan te mennen an egzil Babylone. <verse eid="2KI 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:10-13">II Kwo 36:10-13</ref></char></note>Epi wa Babylone nan te fè tonton Jokajin nan, Matthania, wa nan plas li e li te chanje non li an Sédécias.<verse eid="2KI 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:1">Jr 27:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sédécias te gen laj a venteyen ane lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye pandan onzan Jérusalem. Non manman li se te Hamuthal, fis a Jérémie an nan Libna. <verse eid="2KI 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:37">II Wa 23:37</ref></char></note>selon tout sa ke Jojakim te konn fè yo. <verse eid="2KI 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Det 4:24</ref> </char></note>akoz kòlè SENYÈ a, tout sa te rive Jérusalem avèk Juda jiskaske Li te jete yo deyò prezans Li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Epi Sédécias te fè rebèl kont wa Babylone nan.<verse eid="2KI 24:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">II Kwo 36:17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò nan nevyèm ane règn li an, nan dizyèm jou ak nan dezyèm mwa a, Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan te vini. Li menm avèk tout lame li te fè kan kont Jérusalem, e li te bati yon miray syèj ki te antoure li. <verse eid="2KI 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2"/>Konsa, vil la te anba syèj jis rive nan onzyèm ane a Wa Sédécias la. <verse eid="2KI 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3"/>Nan nevyèm jou ak nan katriyèm mwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:24-25">II Wa 6:24-25</ref></char></note>grangou te tèlman rèd nan vil la ke pa t gen manje pou pèp peyi a. <verse eid="2KI 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Éz 33:21</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te kase vil la antre e tout mesye lagè yo te sove ale nan nwit lan pa pòtay antre de mi yo akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:15">Né 3:15</ref></char></note>jaden a wa a, malgre Kaldeyen yo te antoure tout vil la. Konsa, yo te sòti pa chemen dezè a. <verse eid="2KI 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5"/>Men lame Kaldeyen yo te kouri dèyè wa a. Yo te rive pran li nan plèn Jéricho a, e tout lame li a te gaye kite li. <verse eid="2KI 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:21-22">Jr 34:21-22</ref></char></note>Yo te kaptire wa a e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:4">Jr 32:4</ref></char></note>mennen li kote wa Babylone nan Ribla e yo te pase jijman sou li. <verse eid="2KI 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:6-7">Jr 39:6-7</ref></char></note>Yo te touye fis a Sédécias yo devan zye li, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Éz 12:13</ref> </char></note>pete zye a Sédécias, yo te mare l avèk chenn an bwonz yo, e yo te mennen li Babylone.<verse eid="2KI 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 52:12">Jr 52:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan setyèm jou ak nan senkyèm mwa a, ki se te diznevyèm ane Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, Nebuzaradan, kapitèn gad yo, yon sèvitè a wa Babylone nan, te rive Jérusalem. <verse eid="2KI 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">I Wa 9:8</ref></char></note>Li te brile lakay SENYÈ a, lakay wa a ak tout kay Jérusalem yo. Menm tout gwo kay yo, li te brile yo avèk dife. <verse eid="2KI 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10"/>Epi tout lame Kaldeyen yo ki te avèk kapitèn gad la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:13">II Wa 14:13</ref></char></note>kraze, chire, tout mi ki te antoure Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:20">II Kwo 36:20</ref></char></note>tout rès nan moun ki te kite lavil yo, sila ki te dezète al jwenn wa Babylone nan e tout rès pèp la ki te rete, Nébuzaraden, kapitèn gad la, te pote yo ale an egzil. <verse eid="2KI 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12"/>Men kapitèn gad la te kite kèk moun pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14">II Wa 24:14</ref></char></note>pi malere yo pou sèvi kòm ouvriye nan chan rezen yo ak pou raboure tè a.<verse eid="2KI 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:15-22">I Wa 7:15-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, pilye an bwonz ki te lakay SENYÈ yo ak baz avèk lanmè an bwonz ki te lakay SENYÈ a, Kaldeyen yo te kase yo an mòso e te pote bwonz lan Babylone. <verse eid="2KI 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:47-50">I Wa 7:47-50</ref></char></note>Yo te retire po yo, pèl yo, etennwa yo, kiyè yo ak tout veso an bwonz ki te konn sèvi nan sèvis tanp lan. <verse eid="2KI 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15"/>Kòmandan gad la, anplis, te pran tout plato pou resevwa sann yo, avèk basen yo, sila ki te an lò fen ak sila ki te an ajan fen yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16"/>De pilye yo, yon sèl lanmè a ak baz ke Salomon te fè pou lakay SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:47-50">I Wa 7:47-50</ref></char></note>bwonz nan veso sila yo te depase kapasite pou peze. <verse eid="2KI 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15-22">I Wa 7:15-22</ref></char></note>Wotè a yon pilye te di-zuit koude e yon tèt an bwonz te sou li. Wotè a tèt an bwonz lan te twa koude, avèk yon griyaj ak grenad ki te antoure li an bwonz. Epi dezyèm pilye a te tankou sila yo avèk yon sistèm griyaj.<verse eid="2KI 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18"/>Alò, kapitèn gad la te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:1">Esd 7:1</ref></char></note>Seraja, wo prèt la, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:25-29">Jr 29:25-29</ref></char></note>Sophonie, dezyèm prèt la, avèk twa ofisye a tanp lan. <verse eid="2KI 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19"/>Depi nan vil la, li te pran yon ofisye ki te chèf mesye lagè yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:14">Est 1:14</ref></char></note>senk nan konseye a wa yo ki te twouve nan vil la; epi grefye a kapitèn lame ki te responsab anrejistre moun nan peyi a; epi swasant moun nan pèp peyi a te twouve nan vil la. <verse eid="2KI 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20"/>Nebuzaradan, kapitèn gad la, te pran yo pou te mennen yo kote wa Babylone nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:33">II Wa 23:33</ref></char></note>Ribla. <verse eid="2KI 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21"/>Alò, wa Babylone nan te frape yo e te mete yo a lanmò nan Ribla nan peyi Hamath. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:64">Det 28:64</ref></char></note>Konsa, Juda te mennen an egzil soti nan peyi li.<verse eid="2KI 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22"/>Alò, moun ki te rete nan peyi Juda yo, ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te kite, li te chwazi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:14">Jr 39:14</ref></char></note>Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan, fis a Schaphan an sou yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:7-9">Jr 40:7-9</ref></char></note>Lè tout kapitèn yo avèk sòlda pa yo te tande ke wa Babylone nan te chwazi Guedalia kòm gouvènè, yo te vin kote Guedalia nan Mitspa; pa non, Ismaël fis a Nethania a, avèk Jochanan, fis a Karéach la, Seraja, fis a Thanhumeth la, Netofayit la, avèk Jaazania, fis a Maakatyen an, yo menm avèk mesye pa yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24"/>Guedalia te sèmante a yo avèk mesye pa yo a, e te di yo: “Pa pè vin sèvitè a Kaldeyen yo. Viv nan peyi a, sèvi wa Babylone nan e sa va ale byen pou nou.”<verse eid="2KI 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 41:1-2">Jr 41:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men li te vin rive nan setyèm mwa a, ke Ismaël, fis a Nethania yo, fis a Élischama yo nan fanmi wayal la, te rive avèk dis òm pou te frape Guedalia e li te mouri ansanm avèk Jwif ak Kaldeyen ki te avèk li nan Mitspa yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:4-7">Jr 43:4-7</ref></char></note>Alò, tout pèp la, ni gran ni piti, avèk kapitèn a fòs soulèvman yo te leve ale an Égypte; paske yo te pè Kaldeyen yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Jr 52:31-34</ref></char></note>Alò, li te vin rive nan trant-setyèm ane an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-15">II Wa 24:12-15</ref></char></note>egzil a Jojakin, wa Juda a, nan douzyèm mwa a, nan venn-setyèm jou nan mwa a, ke Évil-Merodac, wa Babylone nan, nan lane ke li te vin wa a, li te lage Jojakin, wa Juda a, soti nan prizon. <verse eid="2KI 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28"/>Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref></char></note>pale avèk dousè anvè li e li te leve twòn li an piwo pase lòt wa ki te avèk li Babylone yo. <verse eid="2KI 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29"/>Jojakin te chanje rad prizonye li yo, e li te vin pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7">II Sam 9:7</ref></char></note>repa l nan prezans a wa a pandan tout rès jou lavi li. <verse eid="2KI 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30"/>Epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:23">Né 11:23</ref></char></note>bous li, yon bous nòmal te bay a li menm pa wa a, yon pòsyon pou chak jou pandan tout jou lavi li.<verse eid="2KI 25:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25"/>
</usx>
